msgid "stage408-large.531"
msgstr "I appreciate it, but I stopped taking those things years ago 'cause they made me drowsy ..."

msgid "stage408-large.532"
msgstr "Hey babe, have you seen this advertisement for a new method to lose weight ...?"

msgid "stage408-large.533"
msgstr "Aha! The diet pills worked as I expected."

msgid "stage408-large.534"
msgstr "I hope she wakes up hours later."

msgid "stage408-large.535"
msgstr "I'd better not wake her up for now."

msgid "stage408-large.536"
msgstr "Hi, who are you?"

msgid "stage408-large.537"
msgstr "I'm Gwendolyn, and you?"

msgid "stage408-large.538"
msgstr "I'm Ron Ashman, of The Quill."

msgid "stage408-large.539"
msgstr "A journalist! I haven't seen many of you around here the last couple of years ..."

msgid "stage408-large.540"
msgstr "Hi Gwendolyn."

msgid "stage408-large.541"
msgstr "Hello, my little caramel cutie."

msgid "stage408-large.542"
msgstr "You've got quite an appetite, eh?"

msgid "stage408-large.543"
msgstr "Tell me about it. I'll be with you in a minute, sugar."

msgid "stage408-large.544"
msgstr "You're having a little snack?"

msgid "stage408-large.545"
msgstr "Yea, though I'm a little chubby, I do like a snack to whet my appetite before dinner."

msgid "stage408-large.546"
msgstr "What can you tell me about the Count?"

msgid "stage408-large.547"
msgstr "We met forty years ago after one of my performances."

msgid "stage408-large.548"
msgstr "One night he just appeared in my dressing room, handsome like the devil, and with just a look of his, he made me melt, forget about my dozens of suitors and give up my career."

msgid "stage408-large.549"
msgstr "Now, the look of his, embitters my life in such a way that only food can make me forget."

msgid "stage408-large.550"
msgstr "I've met Sherilyn. You must be good friends ..."

msgid "stage408-large.551"
msgstr "That harpy?"

msgid "stage408-large.552"
msgstr "You're kidding of course. I can't stand her. She's so vain and capricious ..."

msgid "stage408-large.553"
msgstr "Even her teddy bear, Xavier, had tried to escape on several occasions. I wouldn't trust her if I were you. She never plays fair."

msgid "stage408-large.554"
msgstr "We'll talk later. I have to go."

msgid "stage408-large.555"
msgstr "Goodbye, my little caramel."

msgid "stage408-large.556"
msgstr "Chubby? You? Who said such a mean thing? ..."

msgid "stage408-large.557"
msgstr "No, it's tue, I could probably stand to lose a few pounds, but so you know I can still easily perform a quadruple somersault with a twist on the trapeze."

msgid "stage408-large.558"
msgstr "I thought that vampires drink only blood."

msgid "stage408-large.559"
msgstr "Common movie misconception."

msgid "stage408-large.560"
msgstr "Well, I'd like to talk to you about something else."

msgid "stage408-large.561"
msgstr "Tell me..."

msgid "stage408-large.562"
msgstr "Where is he now?"

msgid "stage408-large.563"
msgstr "I don't know. He's always walking around on the battlements reminiscing his glory days."

msgid "stage408-large.564"
msgstr "I believe that he recently received an award or something."

msgid "stage408-large.565"
msgstr "Yes, as a tribute to his whole career"

msgid "stage408-large.566"
msgstr "That's all they could give him really, because he hasn't even performed for years."

msgid "stage408-large.567"
msgstr "He seems a little depressed."

msgid "stage408-large.568"
msgstr "I'm not surprised at all. In recent years the only thing he did, was to put on weight and lose his hair."

msgid "stage408-large.569"
msgstr "I'll never understand how people can let themselves go like this ..."

msgid "stage408-large.570"
msgstr "Oh, you're a trapeze artist?"

msgid "stage408-large.571"
msgstr "I'm Gwendolyn, “The Flying Swan”, the greatest trapeze artist the world has ever known."

msgid "stage408-large.572"
msgstr "During my number in the central stage of Circus Barnum ..."

msgid "stage408-large.573"
msgstr ".. even the elephants were left breathless!"

msgid "stage408-large.574"
msgstr "Oh, I can imagine! I have no doubt about it!"

msgid "stage408-large.575"
msgstr "Say, do you happen to know a certain Markus Hecker ...?"

msgid "stage408-large.576"
msgstr "Markus??? ..."

msgid "stage408-large.577"
msgstr "... How could I ever forget him?"

msgid "stage408-large.578"
msgstr "I didn't even say a proper goodbye to him."

msgid "stage408-large.579"
msgstr "But now I believe that he was my one true love."

msgid "stage408-large.580"
msgstr "If only I could tell him that ..."

msgid "stage408-large.581"
msgstr "And have you tried any weight loss methods?"

msgid "stage408-large.582"
msgstr "I've tried them all, but all they did was to make me sleepy."

msgid "stage408-large.583"
msgstr "I was sleeping like a log and weighed the same, so I've dropped them."

