msgstr "I'd better not touch anything while the old bat is here."

msgid "stage407-large.510"
msgstr "Who would have thought that a tiger would end this way."

msgid "stage407-large.511"
msgstr "The scenery is really dismal."

msgid "stage407-large.512"
msgstr "He's let himself go a bit, but he still has the same hypnotic eyes as in his movies."

msgid "stage407-large.513"
msgstr "However, I don't think he's dangerous. I'd say that he looks more like a bitter old bat."

msgid "stage407-large.514"
msgstr "I think that if I'm nice to him I might get what I want."

msgid "stage407-large.515"
msgstr "I must keep my eyes open with this guy!"

msgid "stage407-large.516"
msgstr "I could swear that a moment ago he had his mouth open."

msgid "stage407-large.517"
msgstr "I can't open it with my bare hands."

msgid "stage407-large.518"
msgstr "“Nairobi, 1920”"

msgid "stage407-large.519"
msgstr "It is said that if you keep staring at the flames of a blazing fire you can see the souls burning in purgatory ..."

msgid "stage407-large.520"
msgstr "... nah, it sounds completely stupid."

msgid "stage407-large.521"
msgstr "Let's see what we have here ..."

msgid "stage407-large.522"
msgstr "... “A Study in Red” ..."

msgid "stage407-large.523"
msgstr "... “Lycanthropy: Alternative way of life or social position?” ..."

msgid "stage407-large.524"
msgstr "... “Get out of here, you blood sucking bastard!” ..."

msgid "stage407-large.525"
msgstr "... “I've also bitten the dust” ..."

msgid "stage407-large.526"
msgstr "... they're all my favourites!"

msgid "stage407-large.527"
msgstr "I've always prefered that kind of book for a light night reading."

msgid "stage407-large.528"
msgstr "If only I could make him keep his mouth open."

msgid "stage407-large.529"
msgstr "It's not necessary."

msgid "stage407-large.530"
msgstr "He's thrown it out of the window. He doesn't want it back."

msgid "stage407-large.531"
msgstr "Here, Try this method to lose weight and it will solve all of your problems."

msgid "stage407-large.532"
msgstr "Well, I have nothing to lose, I'll try it ..."

msgid "stage407-large.533"
msgstr "... Damn those Dr. Mabuse's pills. They had absolutely no effect. I'm not taking any more."

msgid "stage407-large.534"
msgstr "I have a pamphlet here for a new method to lose weight that looks fantastic ..."

msgid "stage407-large.535"
msgstr "I'm tired of receiving hundreds of pamphlets every day about new “revolutionary” weight loss methods which never work."

msgid "stage407-large.536"
msgstr "I appreciate it but I don't care about it at all."

msgid "stage407-large.537"
msgstr "I want proof, not empty promises."

msgid "stage407-large.538"
msgstr "To be or not be, that is the question ..."

msgid "stage407-large.539"
msgstr "... To die, to sleep, No more ..."

msgid "stage407-large.540"
msgstr "... Whether 'tis nobler in the mind to suffer ..."

msgid "stage407-large.541"
msgstr "... the slings and arrows of outrageous fortune, ..."

msgid "stage407-large.542"
msgstr "... or to take arms against a sea of troubles, and by opposing end them? ..."

msgid "stage407-large.543"
msgstr "Good evening, Count. Do you want me to tell anything to your agent, when I see him? ..."

msgid "stage407-large.544"
msgstr "I don't understand this familiarity young man. I don't know you nor do I know what you are talking about. Please refrain from annoying me any further ..."

msgid "stage407-large.545"
msgstr "... I have less than a week to learn this script, “My girlfriend is a zombie” ..."

msgid "stage407-large.546"
msgstr "... The star of the film is the Werewolf and I play the part of his grandfather on his mother's side ..."

msgid "stage407-large.547"
msgstr "... It's a minor character but a great role!"

msgid "stage407-large.548"
msgstr "I'd better leave. Something very weird is happening here."

msgid "stage407-large.549"
msgstr "Good evening, Count."

msgid "stage407-large.550"
msgstr "I'm Ron Ashman, a reporter for The Quill and I'd like to talk to you."

msgid "stage407-large.551"
msgstr "Good night."

msgid "stage407-large.552"
msgstr "Ask whatever you want sir, but snoop through my things again and you'll regret it."

msgid "stage407-large.553"
msgstr "I don't tolerate strangers, even if they are from the press, who touch my most personal possessions. "

msgid "stage407-large.554"
msgstr "Good evening, Count."

msgid "stage407-large.555"
msgstr "Good evening."

msgid "stage407-large.556"
msgstr "You're rehearsing a new role, right?"

msgid "stage407-large.557"
msgstr "Indeed sir. In fact I am preparing for the role of my carrer. A role that will signal my comeback to the splendor of the glory days, nothing less than ..."

msgid "stage407-large.558"
msgstr "... “Hamlet”."

msgid "stage407-large.559"
msgstr "When the time comes to face this challenge, my interpretation will be fresh, bright ..."

msgid "stage407-large.560"
msgstr "... Sublime ..."

msgid "stage407-large.561"
msgstr "... Divine!"

msgid "stage407-large.562"
msgstr "How does it feel to receive an Academy Honorary Award For Lifetime Achievement?"

msgid "stage407-large.563"
msgstr "If those ignorant fools believe that my career is over, they are sorely mistaken."

msgid "stage407-large.564"
msgstr "My best roles are yet to come."

msgid "stage407-large.565"
msgstr "Hollywood will be mine again."

msgid "stage407-large.566"
msgstr "The world hasn't seen my best performance yet!"

msgid "stage407-large.567"
msgstr "Do you know that you're my favorite actor? I've always loved your films."

msgid "stage407-large.568"
msgstr "Thank you very much! It is great knowing that my art is appreciated."

msgid "stage407-large.569"
msgstr "Too bad that those worms in Hollywood do not think so."

msgid "stage407-large.570"
msgstr "They say I am overweight, that I can't play the handsome protagonist any more ..."

msgid "stage407-large.571"
msgstr "... What do they know about the Seventh Art? My fans still want me, they still write me fan letters ..."

msgid "stage407-large.572"
msgstr "I've noticed that you have excellent company in the castle ..."

msgid "stage407-large.573"
msgstr "Who are you referring to?"

msgid "stage407-large.574"
msgstr "What can you tell me about the party at Hannover's mansion and the Award ceremony?"

msgid "stage407-large.575"
msgstr "Bah! Those parties are but a pale shadow of what they once used to be."

msgid "stage407-large.576"
msgstr "We knew how to have fun those days. And I am talking about all night long fun. Now only second-class monsters are attending."

msgid "stage407-large.577"
msgstr "Well, I won't keep you any longer. It's been a pleasure."

msgid "stage407-large.578"
msgstr "The pleasure was all mine, young mortal. Make sure to spell my name correctly."

msgid "stage407-large.579"
msgstr "A little exercise never hurt anybody."

msgid "stage407-large.580"
msgstr "Exercise? Me? I was great! The Best!"

msgid "stage407-large.581"
msgstr "I terrorized teenagers without doing any exercise. And now that bunch of cheesy monsters are stealing all the headlines ..."

msgid "stage407-large.582"
msgstr "Why don't you try any of the new diet methods?"

msgid "stage407-large.583"
msgstr "I have tried almost everything, but I haven't found anything to be effective."

msgid "stage407-large.584"
msgstr "I am currently taking the famous Dr. Mabuse's pills, but so far I haven't noticed any improvement."

msgid "stage407-large.585"
msgstr "Maybe you should try sleeping less hours."

msgid "stage407-large.586"
msgstr "I do, in winter, when days are shorter. In any case I have no choice, I am subject to the solar time."

msgid "stage407-large.587"
msgstr "I still remember filming “November spawned a monster” in the heart of the Carpathians, in which I almost caught by surprise by a ray of sunshine."

msgid "stage407-large.588"
msgstr "That's when I decided to take no more chances and installed a foolproof system in my room to let me know when the dawn arrives."

msgid "stage407-large.589"
msgstr "Bah! Weight and age do not count when playing the “hero”."

msgid "stage407-large.590"
msgstr "I know it for sure, but the producers aren't able to see beyond the outer appearance."

msgid "stage407-large.591"
msgstr "Sherilyn."

msgid "stage407-large.592"
msgstr "That girl would bore me to death, if I wasn't already dead."

msgid "stage407-large.593"
msgstr "Always so banal, so empty, so shallow ..."

msgid "stage407-large.594"
msgstr "I tried to educate her, refine her in culture and arts ..."

msgid "stage407-large.595"
msgstr "... but the only arts she's interested in are the carnal ones."

msgid "stage407-large.596"
msgstr "Gwendolyn."

msgid "stage407-large.597"
msgstr "I will never stop regretting meeting her that night in Budapest."

msgid "stage407-large.598"
msgstr "She was a Hungarian trapeze acrobat famous for her falls and I was a young actor drunk with fame."

msgid "stage407-large.599"
msgstr "I got carried away by passion and I've been paying for it, for the last forty years."

msgid "stage407-large.600"
msgstr "The skeleton of the dungeons."

msgid "stage407-large.601"
msgstr "I haven't visited that part of the castle for centuries, but I guess those unfortunate souls haven't moved much since the last time I went there."

msgid "stage407-large.602"
msgstr "I'd like to talk about something else."

msgid "stage407-large.603"
msgstr "Well?"

msgid "stage407-large.604"
msgstr "Did you talk with Frankenstein that night?"

msgid "stage407-large.605"
msgstr "Well, yes, of course. I was with him for a few minutes ..."

msgid "stage407-large.606"
msgstr "... but then I lost sight of him and didn't see him again throughout the night."

msgid "stage407-large.607"
msgstr "Did he gave an interview to a newspaper colleague of mine?"

msgid "stage407-large.608"
msgstr "Yes, Miss Bergman. Lovely creature indeed."

msgid "stage407-large.609"
msgstr "It only lasted a few minutes, but later I saw her interviewing the Creature from the Black Lagoon."

msgid "stage407-large.610"
msgstr "As I understand it, he likes to keep very close “relations” with his peers."

msgid "stage407-large.611"
msgstr "Of coure, I can't honestly say that I've never had intercourse with any of mine either..."

