msgstr "We're waiting for the Werewolf of course."

msgid "stage503-large.534"
msgstr "And I know that it may sound weird, but we know he lives nearby and at night he roams around in search for company."

msgid "stage503-large.535"
msgstr "“Company”! As in female companionship!"

msgid "stage503-large.536"
msgstr "How did you come up here?"

msgid "stage503-large.537"
msgstr "We are highly trained Girl Scouts ..."

msgid "stage503-large.538"
msgstr "... It wasn't difficult to climb these mountains, though I scraped my knees more than once."

msgid "stage503-large.539"
msgstr "Oh, and I almost fell off a cliff a couple of times."

msgid "stage503-large.540"
msgstr "Shouldn't you two be at home at this time?"

msgid "stage503-large.541"
msgstr "There are moments in life, that one has to do what one's heart commands ..."

msgid "stage503-large.542"
msgstr "... and I couldn't continue to sleep with only a picture of my idol under the pillow."

msgid "stage503-large.543"
msgstr "I have one under my pillow, one in the drawer at my desk, one in... they're everywhere!"

msgid "stage503-large.544"
msgstr "Do your families know you are here?"

msgid "stage503-large.545"
msgstr "My family thinks I'm staying at Gladys's house and her family thinks she's staying in mine ...."

msgid "stage503-large.546"
msgstr "... clever, uh?"

msgid "stage503-large.547"
msgstr "It certainly is!"

msgid "stage503-large.548"
msgstr "I'll leave you two to play. Good luck and goodbye."

msgid "stage503-large.549"
msgstr "Goodbye Ron."

msgid "stage503-large.550"
msgstr "Yes, goodbye."

msgid "stage503-large.551"
msgstr "What's so special about the Werewolf?"

msgid "stage503-large.552"
msgstr "You're asking WHAT???"

msgid "stage503-large.553"
msgstr "What's so special? You're crazy!"

msgid "stage503-large.554"
msgstr "He's everything a girl could ever want."

msgid "stage503-large.555"
msgstr "He's handsome, strong, funny, sexy ..."

msgid "stage503-large.556"
msgstr "... he's brilliant, the BEST!"

msgid "stage503-large.557"
msgstr "He really is ..."

msgid "stage503-large.558"
msgstr "... the coolest! I'm so in love with him."

msgid "stage503-large.559"
msgstr "Nearby??? There must be miles and miles of tunnels around here."

msgid "stage503-large.560"
msgstr "We know. It actually took us more than six weeks to get here ..."

msgid "stage503-large.561"
msgstr "... but we never lost hope, we'll find him sooner or later."

msgid "stage503-large.562"
msgstr "And we can't get bored here. We sing, play cards, dance ..."

msgid "stage503-large.563"
msgstr "... a little bit of everything."

msgid "stage503-large.564"
msgstr "I don't think waiting for him out here in the woods is such a good idea, girls. The Werewolf is only a Hollywood star.\t\t\t"

msgid "stage503-large.565"
msgstr "You say that because you can't understand."

msgid "stage503-large.566"
msgstr "I am the president and founding member of the Werewolf Fan Club."

msgid "stage503-large.567"
msgstr "I HAVE to know the man behind the character!"

msgid "stage503-large.568"
msgstr "And I... I also ..."

msgid "stage503-large.569"
msgstr "... have to!"

msgid "stage503-large.570"
msgstr "Well, let's leave this topic for now."

msgid "stage503-large.571"
msgstr "I'll never get tired of talking about him. He's the best."

msgid "stage503-large.572"
msgstr "Don't you understand?"

msgid "stage503-large.573"
msgstr "Hi, I'm Ron... and who are you?"

msgid "stage503-large.574"
msgstr "Hello, my name is Gladys."

msgid "stage503-large.575"
msgstr "Hello Gladys."

msgid "stage503-large.576"
msgstr "Hello."

msgid "stage503-large.577"
msgstr "What are you two doing here?"

msgid "stage503-large.578"
msgstr "Nothing really. We're are just sitting idly, like idiots, waiting for the Werewolf to make an appearance."

msgid "stage503-large.579"
msgstr "Oh, I'm really nervous. This is the most exciting thing that ever happened to me in my life."

msgid "stage503-large.580"
msgstr "Don't pay much attention to her, she's hysterical."

msgid "stage503-large.581"
msgstr "How did you get up here?"

msgid "stage503-large.582"
msgstr "Vanessa planned the whole thing ..."

msgid "stage503-large.583"
msgstr "... She's the president of the fan club and I just follow her wherever she goes."

msgid "stage503-large.584"
msgstr "Shut up, Gladys!"

msgid "stage503-large.585"
msgstr "Shouldn't you two be at home at this time?"

msgid "stage503-large.586"
msgstr "Sometimes I miss my bed, my room, my posters ..."

msgid "stage503-large.587"
msgstr "... but I forget everything when I start to think of... the Werewolf ..."

msgid "stage503-large.588"
msgstr "... those eyes! those claws! that snout!"

msgid "stage503-large.589"
msgstr "And that ass Gladys, don't forget that perfect round ass!"

msgid "stage503-large.590"
msgstr "Do your parents know you are here?"

msgid "stage503-large.591"
msgstr "I surely hope not ..."

msgid "stage503-large.592"
msgstr "... If my father finds out, I'm toast!"

msgid "stage503-large.593"
msgstr "If you keep your mouth shut and do exactly what I say, nothing will happen."

msgid "stage503-large.594"
msgstr "I'll leave you two to play. Good luck and goodbye."

msgid "stage503-large.595"
msgstr "Thanks and goodbye."

msgid "stage503-large.596"
msgstr "Goodbye."

msgid "stage503-large.597"
msgstr "What's so special about the Werewolf?"

msgid "stage503-large.598"
msgstr "He's everything to me ..."

msgid "stage503-large.599"
msgstr "When I see him on the screen, my legs start to shake."

msgid "stage503-large.600"
msgstr "I always keep my neck clean so he can bite me some day."

msgid "stage503-large.601"
msgstr "And that ass! It really drives me crazy!"

msgid "stage503-large.602"
msgstr "I think you should go home, Gladys."

msgid "stage503-large.603"
msgstr "Never, without the Werewolf!"

msgid "stage503-large.604"
msgstr "I live for him ... for his howl, his fur... I even adore his fleas."

msgid "stage503-large.605"
msgstr "Also, if you leave me alone, I'll kill you, Gladys."

msgid "stage503-large.606"
msgstr "Well, enough talk about the Werewolf."

msgid "stage503-large.607"
msgstr "As you like Ron, but life would be meaningless without talking about him."

msgid "stage503-large.608"
msgstr "Let him be Gladys. He can't understand."

