msgid "stage504-large.502"
msgstr "Karl, you old fox, you were right about the diamond ..."

msgid "stage504-large.503"
msgstr "... happy now?"

msgid "stage504-large.504"
msgstr "Better not disturb him now. He's very concentrated on chipping away at this wall."

