msgstr "No, thanks."

msgid "stage504-large.506"
msgstr "Impossible. I must remove that pile of rocks first."

msgid "stage504-large.507"
msgstr "He's a little messed up, but you can't help but admire him tenacity."

msgid "stage504-large.508"
msgstr "It doesn't seem serious ..."

msgid "stage504-large.509"
msgstr "... he'll recover."

msgid "stage504-large.510"
msgstr "Better not. It could make him mad."

msgid "stage504-large.511"
msgstr "He uses it to locate diamonds."

msgid "stage504-large.512"
msgstr "Every self-respecting miner owns one of these."

msgid "stage504-large.513"
msgstr "I see, you finally did it, Karl ..."

msgid "stage504-large.514"
msgstr "... I've never doubted that you could ..."

msgid "stage504-large.515"
msgstr "... well, almost, and now I think I'll “borrow” the diamond while you're ..."

msgid "stage504-large.516"
msgstr "... “indisposed”."

msgid "stage504-large.517"
msgstr "It looks like an old sock."

msgid "stage504-large.518"
msgstr "There's a small key inside."

msgid "stage504-large.519"
msgstr "It's empty."

msgid "stage504-large.520"
msgstr "It's full of patches."

msgid "stage504-large.521"
msgstr "He must've been a good man."

msgid "stage504-large.522"
msgstr "I think I should get out of here as soon as possible ..."

msgid "stage504-large.523"
msgstr "I need to use something else."

msgid "stage504-large.524"
msgstr "Pefrect! He didn't even notice the change."

msgid "stage504-large.525"
msgstr "I don't need to change it again."

msgid "stage504-large.526"
msgstr "I don't have time for this."

msgid "stage504-large.527"
msgstr "My God, the divining rod went crazy! ..."

msgid "stage504-large.528"
msgstr "... I'm starting to think that behind this wall lies the mother lode of diamonds that I have been searching for!"

msgid "stage504-large.529"
msgstr "I'm having goosebumps. Penelope, my love, we'll be together soon."

msgid "stage504-large.530"
msgstr "Karl believes he'll find diamonds, but I'd bet that behind this wall lies a nice big piece of gold."

msgid "stage504-large.531"
msgstr "Hey, buddy! ..."

msgid "stage504-large.532"
msgstr "... I have a great divining rod here that I believe it could help you tremendously."

msgid "stage504-large.533"
msgstr "Thanks, but I'd rather keep using my old one ..."

msgid "stage504-large.534"
msgstr "... My grandfather, Klaus, found diamonds as big as his fists with the same divining rod in this same mine and I plan on following on his footsteps ..."

msgid "stage504-large.535"
msgstr "Return it? After all it took me to obtain it? ..."

msgid "stage504-large.536"
msgstr "... No, that would be crazy."

msgid "stage504-large.537"
msgstr "Hi, I'm Ron Ashman."

msgid "stage504-large.538"
msgstr "Hello."

msgid "stage504-large.539"
msgstr "You must be one of the Hecker brothers, aren't you?"

msgid "stage504-large.540"
msgstr "Yeah, I'm Karl. Brother of Markus and Gunther ... How did you know?"

msgid "stage504-large.541"
msgstr "Journalist's intuition."

msgid "stage504-large.542"
msgstr "That's really amazing, but I am glad to see you. I don't see many new faces around here, you know."

msgid "stage504-large.543"
msgstr "What are you doing here?"

msgid "stage504-large.544"
msgstr "Actually, I'm looking for the biggest diamond in the world."

msgid "stage504-large.545"
msgstr "I know it's around here somewhere..."

msgid "stage504-large.546"
msgstr "... and although the mine was abandoned a long time ago, it's still full of surprises."

msgid "stage504-large.547"
msgstr "Have you seen the Werewolf?"

msgid "stage504-large.548"
msgstr "The Werewolf?"

msgid "stage504-large.549"
msgstr "I don't think so... Was I supposed to?"

msgid "stage504-large.550"
msgstr "The closest thing I've seen is a kangaroo that shows up from time to time around here."

msgid "stage504-large.551"
msgstr "How much time have you spent in these tunnels exactly?"

msgid "stage504-large.552"
msgstr "Well, it's difficult to calculate ..."

msgid "stage504-large.553"
msgstr "... I remember coming here a few days after Markus, Gunther and I celebrated our 25th birthday."

msgid "stage504-large.554"
msgstr "We're triplets, you know."

msgid "stage504-large.555"
msgstr "I've heard of you and your brothers. The stubborn Heckers."

msgid "stage504-large.556"
msgstr "I didn't know we were famous ..."

msgid "stage504-large.557"
msgstr "... but the fact remains that none of us gives up easily."

msgid "stage504-large.558"
msgstr "Something that our parents taught us. To mature in the face of adversity ..."

msgid "stage504-large.559"
msgstr "... to be strong and not let ourselves be crushed by anything that life throws on us."

msgid "stage504-large.560"
msgstr "Well, I have to leave you now."

msgid "stage504-large.561"
msgstr "Take care my friend."

msgid "stage504-large.562"
msgstr "I guess it must be hard to find it, in all those tunnels, right?"

msgid "stage504-large.563"
msgstr "Well, I can't deny that it's complicated ..."

msgid "stage504-large.564"
msgstr "... but I have my divining rod to thank for actually locating the diamonds. Whenever I approach a crystal it resonates."

msgid "stage504-large.565"
msgstr "I wouldn't even know where to look, if not for it."

msgid "stage504-large.566"
msgstr "Why is that damn diamond so important?"

msgid "stage504-large.567"
msgstr "You know, when I was 25 years old, I decided it was time for me to settle down ..."

msgid "stage504-large.568"
msgstr "... so I went out to look for a diamond big enough to ask for the hand of my girlfriend in marriage."

msgid "stage504-large.569"
msgstr "Oh, my poor sweet Penelope! ..."

msgid "stage504-large.570"
msgstr "... She'll probably still be sitting and waiting for me at the station."

msgid "stage504-large.571"
msgstr "What kind of surprises?"

msgid "stage504-large.572"
msgstr "Does this tiny one looks to you like a pure diamond the size of a coconut?"

msgid "stage504-large.573"
msgstr "I hope you get lucky and find it soon."

msgid "stage504-large.574"
msgstr "We, Heckers, are stubborn, my friend, if nothing else!"

