msgid "stage305-large.501"
msgstr "... that's Igor, the old servant of Dr. Frankenstein ..."

msgid "stage305-large.502"
msgstr "... You could say that the years haven't exactly been kind to him!"

msgid "stage305-large.503"
msgstr "It leads upstairs ..."

msgid "stage305-large.504"
msgstr "... but that damn Igor stands in my way."

msgid "stage305-large.505"
msgstr "It's a bookcase."

msgid "stage305-large.506"
msgstr "I've always liked these clocks."

msgid "stage305-large.507"
msgstr "I think he's a little off ..."

msgid "stage305-large.508"
msgstr "It's closed. I don't know what's inside."

msgid "stage305-large.509"
msgstr "Better not. It can be dangerous with Igor in front of me."

msgid "stage305-large.510"
msgstr "It smells like Igor is sleeping there."

msgid "stage305-large.511"
msgstr "I would gladly take a nap ..."

msgid "stage305-large.512"
msgstr "... but it's not the right time."

msgid "stage305-large.513"
msgstr "Porcelain kitchenware and stuff like that."

msgid "stage305-large.514"
msgstr "I can't see it very well but it looks great."

msgid "stage305-large.515"
msgstr "You can't kill love!"

msgid "stage305-large.516"
msgstr "The four are watching us!"

msgid "stage305-large.517"
msgstr "And they never forgive!"

msgid "stage305-large.518"
msgstr "And they never forget!"

msgid "stage305-large.519"
msgstr "I know!"

msgid "stage305-large.520"
msgstr "Hi, Igor."

msgid "stage305-large.521"
msgstr "Hold it right there brother!"

msgid "stage305-large.522"
msgstr "What are you doing?"

msgid "stage305-large.523"
msgstr "I'm freeing my mind and my spirit."

msgid "stage305-large.524"
msgstr "I've spent too much time in darkness but I've finally seen the light."

msgid "stage305-large.525"
msgstr "I need your help. We have to put Frankie back together again!"

msgid "stage305-large.526"
msgstr "What do you mean “put back together”???"

msgid "stage305-large.527"
msgstr "Something must be done first to redeem his volatile aura so that it's intrinsic substance becomes again part of his consience."

msgid "stage305-large.528"
msgstr "And thus relieve his karma of its undermining vices."

msgid "stage305-large.529"
msgstr "Where exactly is Dr. Frankenstein?"

msgid "stage305-large.530"
msgstr "He fled ..."

msgid "stage305-large.531"
msgstr "... He fled when he regained his consciousness and faced the horrible things that have happened in his laboratory ..."

msgid "stage305-large.532"
msgstr "... He fled when his hair stood on end, horrified, after reading his own diary which recounted his necrophilic practices ...\t\t\t"

msgid "stage305-large.533"
msgstr "Where the hell is this lab?"

msgid "stage305-large.534"
msgstr "Nooo!!!"

msgid "stage305-large.535"
msgstr "Don't even mention this place where I helped him conduct such a madness that insults all that is holy."

msgid "stage305-large.536"
msgstr "My only salvation lies now in selling incense sticks to repentant sinners who try to walk the hard path of self illumination ..."

msgid "stage305-large.537"
msgstr "... while their souls are heading straight to Purgatory."

msgid "stage305-large.538"
msgstr "Igor, It's absolutely necessary that we find the secret diary of Dr. Frankenstein."

msgid "stage305-large.539"
msgstr "Never!!!"

msgid "stage305-large.540"
msgstr "I'll never touch, nor even mention, again this vile compendium of outcast profanities, for fear of absorbing ..."

msgid "stage305-large.541"
msgstr "... this whirlpool of handwritten nasty intentions ..."

msgid "stage305-large.542"
msgstr "... and that orgy of horrifying depictions designed to drive away my consciousness from the light and the sacred eternal love."

msgid "stage305-large.543"
msgstr "Nice hump!"

msgid "stage305-large.544"
msgstr "Hump?"

msgid "stage305-large.545"
msgstr "What hump???"

msgid "stage305-large.546"
msgstr "Goodbye, buddy."

msgid "stage305-large.547"
msgstr "And remember. You can't kill love ..."

msgid "stage305-large.548"
msgstr "... You can't kill thy neighbor for thy neighbor is thy consciousness and thy consciousness loves you."

