msgid "stage309-large.500"
msgstr "It looks like the man playing the flute is blind ..."

msgid "stage309-large.501"
msgstr "... but he doesn't sound all that bad!"

msgid "stage309-large.502"
msgstr "I can't do it with the old man in front of me."

msgid "stage309-large.503"
msgstr "It looks very old. I don't know what it is."

msgid "stage309-large.504"
msgstr "The secret to rebuilding Frankenstein must be inside."

msgid "stage309-large.505"
msgstr "He seems to enjoy his music."

msgid "stage309-large.506"
msgstr "It's open."

msgid "stage309-large.507"
msgstr "It's closed."

msgid "stage309-large.508"
msgstr "I can't reach it."

msgid "stage309-large.509"
msgstr "It 'a wonderful day."

msgid "stage309-large.510"
msgstr "Nothing like a warm and welcome home."

msgid "stage309-large.511"
msgstr "A handful of salt."

msgid "stage309-large.512"
msgstr "A little salt in the food never hurt anybody."

msgid "stage309-large.513"
msgstr "It's one of those things that's used to locate underground water, wells and things like that."

msgid "stage309-large.514"
msgstr "Straw burns well ..."

msgid "stage309-large.515"
msgstr "It's hot in here!"

msgid "stage309-large.516"
msgstr "I'll open the window ..."

msgid "stage309-large.517"
msgstr "Listen, my good man ..."

msgid "stage309-large.518"
msgstr "... why don't you try playing this saxophone?"

msgid "stage309-large.519"
msgstr "He can play the saxophone as well as the flute."

msgid "stage309-large.520"
msgstr "Is anybody there?"

msgid "stage309-large.521"
msgstr "Hello my friend. My name is Ashman, Ron Ashman."

msgid "stage309-large.522"
msgstr "Welcome to my humble abode, friend."

msgid "stage309-large.523"
msgstr "I am a poor, blind, old man, but please be my guest for a while ..."

msgid "stage309-large.524"
msgstr "... although as you can see, I have little to offer beyond my music."

msgid "stage309-large.525"
msgstr "Good morning."

msgid "stage309-large.526"
msgstr "Welcome back."

msgid "stage309-large.527"
msgstr "Nice cabin."

msgid "stage309-large.528"
msgstr "Thank you very much. Despite my limitations, I try to keep it as pleasant as possible."

msgid "stage309-large.529"
msgstr "It's a bit small but it has its advantages too. It doesn't take long to clean it, the fireplace doesn't need much wood ..."

msgid "stage309-large.530"
msgstr "... and everything I need is in hand's reach."

msgid "stage309-large.531"
msgstr "I'm looking for Dr. Frankenstein. Do you know where I can find him?"

msgid "stage309-large.532"
msgstr "Unfortunately no. Victor left for shores unknown years ago and I haven't heard from him since."

msgid "stage309-large.533"
msgstr "Before he left, he entrusted me with something to give, either to his offspring or to him when I deemed him ready ..."

msgid "stage309-large.534"
msgstr "... but that time hasn't arrived yet."

msgid "stage309-large.535"
msgstr "I saw a little girl around here... Do you know her?"

msgid "stage309-large.536"
msgstr "Unfortunately yes."

msgid "stage309-large.537"
msgstr "That's Amanda. She's a real wolf in sheep's clothing."

msgid "stage309-large.538"
msgstr "She enjoys putting obstacles in my path for me to stumble on and she rearranges my things just for fun ..."

msgid "stage309-large.539"
msgstr "... Her last awful prank involved hiding my laxative."

msgid "stage309-large.540"
msgstr "I really love music."

msgid "stage309-large.541"
msgstr "Music can tame even the wildest beasts, you know."

msgid "stage309-large.542"
msgstr "When I'm playing, I feel in harmony with nature and disconnected from everything."

msgid "stage309-large.543"
msgstr "Igor, the servant of Frankenstein, is a little crazy, right?"

msgid "stage309-large.544"
msgstr "Just a little? He's always been a few cards short of a full deck, but lately he's gotten into a cult that's completely out of control."

msgid "stage309-large.545"
msgstr "Sometimes I can hear him sing and dance until dawn from high up on the trees."

msgid "stage309-large.546"
msgstr "Thanks for your hospitality my friend, but I have to leave now."

msgid "stage309-large.547"
msgstr "Come back whenever you want. It's been a pleasure."

msgid "stage309-large.548"
msgstr "And what did he entrusted you with?"

msgid "stage309-large.549"
msgstr "His diary. Something that Victor worked in, for many years ..."

msgid "stage309-large.550"
msgstr "... I have kept it safe in the top shelf, away from the hands of strangers."

msgid "stage309-large.551"
msgstr "And why Frankie isn't ready?"

msgid "stage309-large.552"
msgstr "He has so much more to learn about this world."

msgid "stage309-large.553"
msgstr "Well, you can almost say that he was born yesterday."

msgid "stage309-large.554"
msgstr "I believe Frankie is ready. You can give it to me and I'll make sure he gets it."

msgid "stage309-large.555"
msgstr "Impossible!"

msgid "stage309-large.556"
msgstr "I gave my word to Victor that his journal would never be touched again by anyone, except for me and his offspring."

msgid "stage309-large.557"
msgstr "Let's talk about something else."

msgid "stage309-large.558"
msgstr "Anything I can get you?"

msgid "stage309-large.559"
msgstr "Laxative?"

msgid "stage309-large.560"
msgstr "Well, yes. You see, my body has taken a lot of punishment over the years and I'm not young anymore, so it needs a little push to function properly."

msgid "stage309-large.561"
msgstr "What kind of laxative?"

msgid "stage309-large.562"
msgstr "There're some flowers that grow around here. Very similar to the common daisy ..."

msgid "stage309-large.563"
msgstr "... You steep them in boiling water and trust me when I say this ..."

msgid "stage309-large.564"
msgstr "... the results are almost instantaneous."

msgid "stage309-large.565"
msgstr "We'd better change the subject ..."

msgid "stage309-large.566"
msgstr "As you wish."

msgid "stage309-large.567"
msgstr "Don't you ever get tired of playing the same music instrument every day?"

msgid "stage309-large.568"
msgstr "Well, I'd love to have more ..."

msgid "stage309-large.569"
msgstr "... but my resources are very limited and a poor old man like me can't afford to cater to his every whim.\t"

msgid "stage309-large.570"
msgstr "Is this the only song you can play?"

msgid "stage309-large.571"
msgstr "The truth is that I knew another one, but I somehow forgot it."

msgid "stage309-large.572"
msgstr "Moving on ..."

msgid "stage309-large.573"
msgstr "Yes?"

msgid "stage309-large.574"
msgstr "Does he really sing and dance until dawn from high up on the trees?"

msgid "stage309-large.575"
msgstr "Yes, or at least I can hear that his voice comes from a certain height ..."

msgid "stage309-large.576"
msgstr "... Who knows? Maybe he invented a way to fly."

msgid "stage309-large.577"
msgstr "And there's no way to reason with him?"

msgid "stage309-large.578"
msgstr "With that crackpot? One has to be as crazy as him in order to understand him."

msgid "stage309-large.579"
msgstr "A cult?"

msgid "stage309-large.580"
msgstr "It seems that way ..."

msgid "stage309-large.581"
msgstr "... Who else could've taught him these little dance steps he repeats for hours while he recites verses about love and consciousness?"

msgid "stage309-large.582"
msgstr "Damn... I thought this kind of thing could only happen in the city."

msgid "stage309-large.583"
msgstr "No one is safe from this kind of threat."

msgid "stage309-large.584"
msgstr "You have to be strong, my friend, very strong."

msgid "stage309-large.585"
msgstr "About that stick on the wall ..."

msgid "stage309-large.586"
msgstr "That's my divining rod ..."

msgid "stage309-large.587"
msgstr "A present from a travelling merchant who passed through here a few years ago."

msgid "stage309-large.588"
msgstr "It seems to have the ability to find gold ..."

msgid "stage309-large.589"
msgstr "... but frankly I've never found anything."

