msgid "stage310-large.500"
msgstr "It leads to the cabin in the woods."

msgid "stage310-large.501"
msgstr "It's a helpless little girl sitting on the riverbank."

msgid "stage310-large.502"
msgstr "What a hateful little girl!"

msgid "stage310-large.503"
msgstr "It's one of the flowers the little girl disliked and threw into the creek."

msgid "stage310-large.504"
msgstr "That was hard ..."

msgid "stage310-large.505"
msgstr "... but it was worth it."

msgid "stage310-large.506"
msgstr "Full of life."

msgid "stage310-large.507"
msgstr "It's an old rotten tree trunk."

msgid "stage310-large.508"
msgstr "It doesn't seem very deep."

msgid "stage310-large.509"
msgstr "It's so full of life that it won't be affected if I take a little of its sap."

msgid "stage310-large.510"
msgstr "Hello little girl. What's your name?"

msgid "stage310-large.511"
msgstr "I don't talk to strangers ..."

msgid "stage310-large.512"
msgstr "... Beat it!"

msgid "stage310-large.513"
msgstr "Well, I'm Ron Ashman. A journalist for The Quill."

msgid "stage310-large.514"
msgstr "And who asked you, deadbeat?"

msgid "stage310-large.515"
msgstr "Hey, little girl."

msgid "stage310-large.516"
msgstr "Are you still here?"

msgid "stage310-large.517"
msgstr "My, what a pretty little dress you're wearing!"

msgid "stage310-large.518"
msgstr "My daddy gave it to me and it's custom made with the rarest and most expensive fabric in the region."

msgid "stage310-large.519"
msgstr "All the girls at school envy me ..."

msgid "stage310-large.520"
msgstr "... and not just for my dress, but for my golden hair and my porcelain skin also."

msgid "stage310-large.521"
msgstr "I can't help it, I am awesome ..."

msgid "stage310-large.522"
msgstr "... What can I do? I'm just superior."

msgid "stage310-large.523"
msgstr "What are you doing sitting here?"

msgid "stage310-large.524"
msgstr "I'm throwing daisies in the creek."

msgid "stage310-large.525"
msgstr "I like to watch as the current plays with them and makes them sink gradually."

msgid "stage310-large.526"
msgstr "May I have a daisy?"

msgid "stage310-large.527"
msgstr "You?"

msgid "stage310-large.528"
msgstr "Why would a bum like you even want a daisy? "

msgid "stage310-large.529"
msgstr "No can do! My teacher says that “Honey isn't made for the donkey's mouth”."

msgid "stage310-large.530"
msgstr "Keep playing little girl, I have to go."

msgid "stage310-large.531"
msgstr "Yeah, you'd better go away and don't ever bother me again or I'll start yelling and screaming until I get sick ..."

msgid "stage310-large.532"
msgstr "... and you know I can do it."

msgid "stage310-large.533"
msgstr "And don't you afraid that you'll get it dirty, sitting there?"

msgid "stage310-large.534"
msgstr "I'm cautious and treat it very carefully and gently ..."

msgid "stage310-large.535"
msgstr "... In addition, it's scented with eau de cologne and lavender."

msgid "stage310-large.536"
msgstr "I'm always radiant and flawless."

msgid "stage310-large.537"
msgstr "That's because they are not as beautiful as you."

msgid "stage310-large.538"
msgstr "I know. They are worthless."

msgid "stage310-large.539"
msgstr "I prefer to play alone with my own games than deal with this crude bunch of commoners."

msgid "stage310-large.540"
msgstr "That's because you're a monster, you hateful devil child."

msgid "stage310-large.541"
msgstr "You can't hurt me. I don't care. I know that everything you say is out of sheer envy."

msgid "stage310-large.542"
msgstr "Don't worry. It's enough for me that I've spoken my mind."

msgid "stage310-large.543"
msgstr "Well, I'd like to talk about something else."

msgid "stage310-large.544"
msgstr "Please stop boring me with your limited vocabulary and walk away ..."

msgid "stage310-large.545"
msgstr "... you're ruining the scenery."

msgid "stage310-large.546"
msgstr "I said no. Wasn't I perfectly clear?"

msgid "stage310-large.547"
msgstr "I have only a dozen. I can't afford to give one away."

msgid "stage310-large.548"
msgstr "No. I couldn't let hands like yours touch something so delicate."

msgid "stage310-large.549"
msgstr "Dream on."

msgid "stage310-large.550"
msgstr "I won't give you anything, stinky!"

msgid "stage310-large.551"
msgstr "It wouldn't hurt to try to cover your stink ..."

msgid "stage310-large.552"
msgstr "... but I won't do it."

msgid "stage310-large.553"
msgstr "Never, ever."

msgid "stage310-large.554"
msgstr "I would't give you one, even if your life depended on it."

msgid "stage310-large.555"
msgstr "These daisies belong to me, and there's nothing you can do to make me give you one."

msgid "stage310-large.556"
msgstr "There's still something I CAN do! ..."

msgid "stage310-large.557"
msgstr "Oh, poor little thing ..."

msgid "stage310-large.558"
msgstr "... she slipped!"

msgid "stage310-large.559"
msgstr "A “good” girl like her, I'm pretty sure, knows how to swim."

