msgid "stage307-small.10"
msgstr " Frankenstein"

msgid "stage307-large.500"
msgstr "Just as I suspected! ..."

msgid "stage307-large.501"
msgstr "... the secret laboratory of Dr. Frankenstein!"

msgid "stage307-large.502"
msgstr "It communicates with the library."

msgid "stage307-large.503"
msgstr "It's only natural."

msgid "stage307-large.504"
msgstr "It looks like it hasn't been used in a long time."

msgid "stage307-large.505"
msgstr "Frankenstein is ready to repeat the experiment."

msgid "stage307-large.506"
msgstr "It's full of dust."

msgid "stage307-large.507"
msgstr "It's somewhat old but still usable."

msgid "stage307-large.508"
msgstr "It doesn't seem very complicated."

msgid "stage307-large.509"
msgstr "I'm not sure exactly how it works, but it seems that there's a switch that starts the whole system ..."

msgid "stage307-large.510"
msgstr "... In any case I'll wait till everything is ready."

msgid "stage307-large.511"
msgstr "Closed."

msgid "stage307-large.512"
msgstr "There's a needle with a thread inside ..."

msgid "stage307-large.513"
msgstr "... the kind that surgeons use."

msgid "stage307-large.514"
msgstr "It's empty."

msgid "stage307-large.515"
msgstr "It's one of those that surgeons use in operations."

msgid "stage307-large.516"
msgstr "As long as he's in this state he can't answer back."

msgid "stage307-large.517"
msgstr "I'd better leave it where it is."

msgid "stage307-large.518"
msgstr "Frankie hang in there ..."

msgid "stage307-large.519"
msgstr "... Just a little more."

msgid "stage307-large.520"
msgstr "Next time will be the last one, Frankie. I promise."

msgid "stage307-large.521"
msgstr "Well, I think everything is set. The serum of life is ready, Frankie is on the operating table and I have glasses for protection. Let's see if this contraption works ..."

msgid "stage307-large.522"
msgstr "It's working! ..."

msgid "stage307-large.523"
msgstr "... and finally the moment has arrived!"

msgid "stage307-large.524"
msgstr "Frankie?"

msgid "stage307-large.525"
msgstr "Frankie?... How do you feel?"

msgid "stage307-large.526"
msgstr "Damn! ..."

msgid "stage307-large.527"
msgstr "It didn't work ..."

msgid "stage307-large.528"
msgstr "What could have happened ...?"

msgid "stage307-large.529"
msgstr "... Unless ..."

msgid "stage307-large.530"
msgstr "... Now I get it ..."

msgid "stage307-large.531"
msgstr "... The brain!!!"

msgid "stage307-large.532"
msgstr "It has something to do with the brain of Frankenstein!"

msgid "stage307-large.533"
msgstr "I have to recover it at any cost."

msgid "stage307-large.534"
msgstr "This time I can't fail."

msgid "stage307-large.535"
msgstr "Frankie?"

msgid "stage307-large.536"
msgstr "That's not possible! ..."

msgid "stage307-large.537"
msgstr "... I've failed again?"

msgid "stage307-large.538"
msgstr "What am I doing here ...?"

msgid "stage307-large.539"
msgstr "... Where am I? ..."

msgid "stage307-large.540"
msgstr "... And who are you?"

msgid "stage307-large.541"
msgstr "There's no time for explanations! ..."

msgid "stage307-large.542"
msgstr "... I am just a friend."

msgid "stage307-large.543"
msgstr "Now tell me... What happened the night of the party in Hannover's warehouse?"

msgid "stage307-large.544"
msgstr "I only know that you were with my partner, Sue Bergman ..."

msgid "stage307-large.545"
msgstr "Hannover? ..."

msgid "stage307-large.546"
msgstr "... Bergman? ..."

msgid "stage307-large.547"
msgstr "... warehouse?"

msgid "stage307-large.548"
msgstr "Yes, now I remember!!!"

msgid "stage307-large.549"
msgstr "It's terrible!"

msgid "stage307-large.550"
msgstr "Listen. That same night, in the middle of the party, I went for a walk in the garden ..."

msgid "stage307-large.551"
msgstr "... I was preoccupied, thinking about my latest paper on the evolution of the drosophila fly in coexistence with the potato flea when I heard voices coming from behind a bush ..."

msgid "stage307-large.552"
msgstr "... As I approached I saw that it was Otto Hannover talking to a weird guy that he called Dr. Karloff ..."

msgid "stage307-large.553"
msgstr "... about their machiavellian plan. I almost froze. From what I could hear, he was planning to replace all the famous monsters with doubles so he could manipulate them at will and ..."

msgid "stage307-large.554"
msgstr "... this Dr. Karloff was the one who was going to take care of it. I couldn't stand hearing any more so I rushed out of there and tried to tell someone what was going on ..."

msgid "stage307-large.555"
msgstr "... The ballroom was so crowded that I couldn't find my good friend the Invisible Man ..."

msgid "stage307-large.556"
msgstr "... so I asked the steward to give him a note, telling him to meet me in the warehouse as soon as possible ..."

msgid "stage307-large.557"
msgstr "... but the one who actually showed was your friend, Sue Bergman, and right when I was about to tell her everything the lights went out and somebody hit me in the head ..."

msgid "stage307-large.558"
msgstr "... And from that moment on, I don't remember anything."

msgid "stage307-large.559"
msgstr "So Hannover is behind all this ..."

msgid "stage307-large.560"
msgstr "... I never liked that guy."

msgid "stage307-large.561"
msgstr "Now I understand a lot of things. The pieces are starting to fit together ..."

msgid "stage307-large.562"
msgstr "Relax, Frankie, I'll take care of everything."

msgid "stage307-large.563"
msgstr "Hannover won't get away with it!"

msgid "stage307-large.564"
msgstr "Without the brain, the experiment is doomed to fail."

msgid "stage307-large.565"
msgstr "Well... All set!"

msgid "stage307-large.566"
msgstr "I think I'll wait until I have the whole body."

msgid "stage307-large.567"
msgstr "No, I prefer not to, until I have all the pieces together."

msgid "stage307-large.568"
msgstr "I'll place all the pieces of Frankie on the table and sew them together with the needle and thread."

msgid "stage307-large.569"
msgstr "I see no reason to."

msgid "stage307-large.570"
msgstr "I think that's everything I need for the serum of life."

msgid "stage307-large.571"
msgstr "A jelly bean can serve as glucose."

msgid "stage307-large.572"
msgstr "This bone will serve as calcium."

msgid "stage307-large.573"
msgstr "The sap of a plant is like the blood of a living being. This will do."

msgid "stage307-large.574"
msgstr "The remains of an egg will serve as amniotic fluid."

msgid "stage307-large.575"
msgstr "I don't have all the ingredients to prepare the serum of life."

msgid "stage307-large.576"
msgstr "First, I need something to protect my eyes."

msgid "stage307-large.577"
msgstr "It's used to start this whole mechanism."

msgid "stage307-large.578"
msgstr "No, I'm still not quite ready to start the experiment."

msgid "stage307-large.579"
msgstr "No, I still need a good lightning storm to perform the experiment"

msgid "stage307-large.580"
msgstr "It will serve as citric acid."

msgid "stage307-large.581"
msgstr "And you say that you found it in the warehouse?"

msgid "stage307-large.582"
msgstr "Yes, I went to the warehouse for a bottle of wine and there it was lying on the ground behind some barrels."

msgid "stage307-large.583"
msgstr "I'm sure it was one of those damn zombies. Last night, with all the mess of the party, somebody must have gotten in my pantry, took it ..."

msgid "stage307-large.584"
msgstr "... then hid it in the warehouse and then forgot to pick it up."

msgid "stage307-large.585"
msgstr "This will go great with our fricassee!"

msgid "stage307-large.586"
msgstr "Elmer, Merci mon ami. I've looking all over for it! I'll store it in the pantry and go get some rest ..."

msgid "stage307-large.587"
msgstr "... I believe I've earned it after all that happened last night. Bon soir!"

msgid "stage307-large.588"
msgstr "Sweet dreams, Francois!"

