msgstr "They're so dark I can't even see her eyes."

msgid "stage202-large.516"
msgstr "It looks like that the Princess left them behind."

msgid "stage202-large.517"
msgstr "Here, kitty. Bon appetit."

msgid "stage202-large.518"
msgstr "Here, kitten. Here's a tasty piece of meat"

msgid "stage202-large.519"
msgstr "Too bad, you didn't have a strong denture, pal!"

msgid "stage202-large.520"
msgstr "Hi, I am Ron Ashman of The Quill."

msgid "stage202-large.521"
msgstr "The press! So what?"

msgid "stage202-large.522"
msgstr "Errr, nothing ..."

msgid "stage202-large.523"
msgstr "... I just wanted to talk to you for a moment."

msgid "stage202-large.524"
msgstr "You have two minutes."

msgid "stage202-large.525"
msgstr "You must be the wife of the Mummy, right?"

msgid "stage202-large.526"
msgstr "I'm Princess Amesis-Huni, daughter of Amenophesis IV."

msgid "stage202-large.527"
msgstr "Excuse me, can I bother for a moment?"

msgid "stage202-large.528"
msgstr "ou are trying my patience, you know ..."

msgid "stage202-large.529"
msgstr "... What the hell do you want this time?"

msgid "stage202-large.530"
msgstr "Can we talk about your husband?"

msgid "stage202-large.531"
msgstr "What do you want to know?"

msgid "stage202-large.532"
msgstr "Your pet... He's not really dangerous, right?"

msgid "stage202-large.533"
msgstr "My dear Khami ..."

msgid "stage202-large.534"
msgstr "... is totally obedient and faithful ..."

msgid "stage202-large.535"
msgstr "... He does everything I want with a mere wave of my hand ..."

msgid "stage202-large.536"
msgstr "... but I'm still trying to manage his cravings ..."

msgid "stage202-large.537"
msgstr "... When he sees something tasty he just can't controll himself."

msgid "stage202-large.538"
msgstr "I can see, you're living the good life here."

msgid "stage202-large.539"
msgstr "It may come as a surprise to you but ..."

msgid "stage202-large.540"
msgstr "... I had to lay off my whole court of Vestal Virgins a few days ago."

msgid "stage202-large.541"
msgstr "And it's very difficult to find servants who are both capable and responsible these days!"

msgid "stage202-large.542"
msgstr "And if you do then they ask you for a salary, medical insurance, vacation days ..."

msgid "stage202-large.543"
msgstr "... Slavery is not what it used to be ..."

msgid "stage202-large.544"
msgstr "... They've even formed a union!"

msgid "stage202-large.545"
msgstr "Four thousand years ago they would have been dinner for my Nile crocodiles"

msgid "stage202-large.546"
msgstr "I won't bother you any more."

msgid "stage202-large.547"
msgstr "I sure hope so."

msgid "stage202-large.548"
msgstr "Isn't it true that it was your husband who returned you to the world of the living?"

msgid "stage202-large.549"
msgstr "Hah! Sure, that's what he's led the world to believe ..."

msgid "stage202-large.550"
msgstr "... but in the end it was I who brought him back to the world ..."

msgid "stage202-large.551"
msgstr "... Before my return, he was just a wandering old mummy."

msgid "stage202-large.552"
msgstr "And just between us, kiddo ..."

msgid "stage202-large.553"
msgstr "... without me, that man is just worthless!"

msgid "stage202-large.554"
msgstr "Is there a chance he may be involved in something shady?"

msgid "stage202-large.555"
msgstr "Something shady?"

msgid "stage202-large.556"
msgstr "Please, don't make me laugh. That man isn't capable of scratching his nose by himself."

msgid "stage202-large.557"
msgstr "What about his acting career?"

msgid "stage202-large.558"
msgstr "The only reason he's doing so well, is because of the prestige that comes from being by my side ... "

msgid "stage202-large.559"
msgstr "The Werewolf on the other side! Well, that's an actor ..."

msgid "stage202-large.560"
msgstr "... and a real man."

msgid "stage202-large.561"
msgstr "His fur is so unique."

msgid "stage202-large.562"
msgstr "Let's talk about something else."

msgid "stage202-large.563"
msgstr "If it's not a waste of time ..."

msgid "stage202-large.564"
msgstr "... I can see that there's very little of that old love story that still remains."

msgid "stage202-large.565"
msgstr "Actually I never really loved him. It was rather a question of... of..."

msgid "stage202-large.566"
msgstr "... well, let's say... personal interest."

msgid "stage202-large.567"
msgstr "Then why are you still with him?"

msgid "stage202-large.568"
msgstr "It's all part of the deal. Immortality has a price, you know ..."

msgid "stage202-large.569"
msgstr "... If I go back on my word, Isis's wrath would fall on me."

