msgid "stage203-large.556"
msgstr "Do you have flowers of the Nile?"

msgid "stage203-large.557"
msgstr "Do I have flowers of the Nile? Do I have flowers of the Nile? Do I have? Ah, yes! I have! The best seeds this side of the Nile."

msgid "stage203-large.558"
msgstr "They grow almost immediately, but they need pure water and authentic Egyptian sunlight."

msgid "stage203-large.559"
msgstr "They only cost 250 dollars."

msgid "stage203-large.560"
msgstr "How about a parchment with a spell to return someone, who's been resurrected, back to the Afterlife?"

