msgid "stage208-large.501"
msgstr "... I've almost deciphered it ..."

msgid "stage208-large.502"
msgstr "... But I still don't know what exactly this curse is. All I know is that all who cross the two chambers of the Sacred Seal must not go back or the curse will fall on them."

msgid "stage208-large.503"
msgstr "No way!"

msgid "stage208-large.504"
msgstr "I don't believe in curses ..."

msgid "stage208-large.505"
msgstr "... but in any case, I'd prefer not be the one that crosses the door first."

msgid "stage208-large.506"
msgstr "Let's see what I can learn from Gunther about this curse ..."

msgid "stage208-large.507"
msgstr "I won't be the first to go through that door ..."

msgid "stage208-large.508"
msgstr "... I've got a strange feeling in my gut."

msgid "stage208-large.509"
msgstr "That Gunther guy sure is dedicated."

msgid "stage208-large.510"
msgstr "I know that face."

msgid "stage208-large.511"
msgstr "He's one of the eccentric Hecker brothers ..."

msgid "stage208-large.512"
msgstr "I like it because it has a firm grip."

msgid "stage208-large.513"
msgstr "Damn!"

msgid "stage208-large.514"
msgstr "It's empty ..."

msgid "stage208-large.515"
msgstr "... let's hope the owner hasn't gone out for a walk around here."

msgid "stage208-large.516"
msgstr "It doesn't look very luxurious to belong to a princess."

msgid "stage208-large.517"
msgstr "The last thing I wanna do is get into one of these."

msgid "stage208-large.518"
msgstr "It's in perfect condition after so many centuries."

msgid "stage208-large.519"
msgstr "I don't even understand how can anybody be able to decipher it."

msgid "stage208-large.520"
msgstr "I wonder what's up there ..."

msgid "stage208-large.521"
msgstr "It's the entrance to the sacred altar of Karnak."

msgid "stage208-large.522"
msgstr "No can do."

msgid "stage208-large.523"
msgstr "I have no special interest in this sarcophagus."

msgid "stage208-large.524"
msgstr "Let's see ..."

msgid "stage208-large.525"
msgstr "Look what we have here! ..."

msgid "stage208-large.526"
msgstr "... a hair from the very same Princess!"

msgid "stage208-large.527"
msgstr "Great! That's just what I needed."

msgid "stage208-large.528"
msgstr "I don't think I'll find anything interesting here."

msgid "stage208-large.529"
msgstr "What? What was that?"

msgid "stage208-large.530"
msgstr "Hi, I am Ron Ashman, and you are? ..."

msgid "stage208-large.531"
msgstr "Hecker, Gunter Hecker ..."

msgid "stage208-large.532"
msgstr "... professor of Archeology and Egyptology at the University of Cairo."

msgid "stage208-large.533"
msgstr "Hello, Professor Hecker."

msgid "stage208-large.534"
msgstr "Hello, friend."

msgid "stage208-large.535"
msgstr "What are you looking at?"

msgid "stage208-large.536"
msgstr "I'm about to decipher these hieroglyphics ..."

msgid "stage208-large.537"
msgstr "... I've been struggling for months now, but finally I believe I'm very close to deciphering them."

msgid "stage208-large.538"
msgstr "It's about a curse that will befall anyone who dares to desecrate the sacred altar of Karnak ..."

msgid "stage208-large.539"
msgstr "... but I can't understand the last part, which explains what exactly is this terrible curse."

msgid "stage208-large.540"
msgstr "Where are we now?"

msgid "stage208-large.541"
msgstr "We're in the sacred chamber of Amesis-Huni ..."

msgid "stage208-large.542"
msgstr "... Here is where the mummified body of the Princess was found."

msgid "stage208-large.543"
msgstr "Ours are the first human eyes to marvel at this sight since it was sealed thousands of years ago."

msgid "stage208-large.544"
msgstr "I know the meaning of these hieroglyphics."

msgid "stage208-large.545"
msgstr "Really?"

msgid "stage208-large.546"
msgstr "I've found that apparently the danger lies in getting out of this damn room ..."

msgid "stage208-large.547"
msgstr "... but I still don't understand the final part!"

msgid "stage208-large.548"
msgstr "Nice folks your brothers Markus and Karl ..."

msgid "stage208-large.549"
msgstr "You know them?"

msgid "stage208-large.550"
msgstr "My brothers are extraordinary, but I haven't seen them in a long time."

msgid "stage208-large.551"
msgstr "Karl sent me a letter a few months back, but Markus hasn't written recently ..."

msgid "stage208-large.552"
msgstr "... He must still be angry with me. He's always been a bit resentful."

msgid "stage208-large.553"
msgstr "Well... How are they faring?"

msgid "stage208-large.554"
msgstr "Please, don't bother me any more. I need to concentrate."

msgid "stage208-large.555"
msgstr "As you wish."

msgid "stage208-large.556"
msgstr "But then... the curse will fall upon us?"

msgid "stage208-large.557"
msgstr "That's what I'm afraid of. Unless I can decipher these hieroglyphics ..."

msgid "stage208-large.558"
msgstr "... there's only one way we'll know what'll happen to us."

msgid "stage208-large.559"
msgstr "Great, great. They're all fine and send you their best regards."

msgid "stage208-large.560"
msgstr "Maybe we'll meet again someday, the three of us. I'd really love to."

msgid "stage208-large.561"
msgstr "It is very clear. It says it's all a big hoax."

msgid "stage208-large.562"
msgstr "You think so?"

msgid "stage208-large.563"
msgstr "The last hieroglyph clearly says that the curse is meant as a joke."

msgid "stage208-large.564"
msgstr "No, I'm not convinced. The Egyptians weren't known for their sense of humor."

msgid "stage208-large.565"
msgstr "I'll keep trying to decipher it."

msgid "stage208-large.566"
msgstr "I think it says that nothing will happen as long as we don't steal anything."

msgid "stage208-large.567"
msgstr "There's no doubt. It means that the curse would expire in the 16th century."

msgid "stage208-large.568"
msgstr "Sure, no doubt at all."

msgid "stage208-large.569"
msgstr "Maybe you're right ..."

msgid "stage208-large.570"
msgstr "That's it. I wouldn't have noticed it if not for the inverted palm symbol."

msgid "stage208-large.571"
msgstr "The slanting nature of the last symbols leaves no room for doubt."

msgid "stage208-large.572"
msgstr "That's a spelling mistake, but now I'm sure what it means."

msgid "stage208-large.573"
msgstr "There's no doubt anymore. It's absolutely safe to exit the room."

msgid "stage208-large.574"
msgstr "I think you're right ..."

msgid "stage208-large.575"
msgstr "I've been such a fool. It was right before my eyes all this time ..."

msgid "stage208-large.576"
msgstr "... I can't believe that after so many years in the University, I haven't been able to figure out these details of the hieroglyphics."

msgid "stage208-large.577"
msgstr "Now finally I know the secret of the curse. I must leave here and go revise my notes ..."

msgid "stage208-large.578"
msgstr "Not a moment to lose!"

msgid "stage208-large.579"
msgstr "Are you coming?"

msgid "stage208-large.580"
msgstr "Go on ahead. I'm right behind you."

msgid "stage208-large.581"
msgstr "Okay, friend. See you later, then!"

msgid "stage208-large.582"
msgstr "Of course. There's no need to fear anything anymore."

msgid "stage208-large.583"
msgstr "Let's go Gunther... Would I lie to you?"

msgid "stage208-large.584"
msgstr "Sure, we can finally leave whenever we want."

