msgstr "It leads to the gardens."

msgid "stage102-large.502"
msgstr "I'm a strong guy, but that's too much."

msgid "stage102-large.503"
msgstr "There's something down there ..."

msgid "stage102-large.504"
msgstr "A cassette tape like the ones we use at The Quill!"

msgid "stage102-large.505"
msgstr "... I'd bet anything that it belongs to Sue."

msgid "stage102-large.506"
msgstr "Maybe if I listen to it I'd be able to find something, I have to get it."

msgid "stage102-large.507"
msgstr "Impossible without lifting the grate first."

msgid "stage102-large.508"
msgstr "It took some effort, but now it's mine."

msgid "stage102-large.509"
msgstr "I have no idea how it ended up down there. "

msgid "stage102-large.510"
msgstr "The mechanism controls the hook and the pulley."

msgid "stage102-large.511"
msgstr "I guess it's used to move the barrels. "

msgid "stage102-large.512"
msgstr "It doesn't move, the rail is very rusty. "

msgid "stage102-large.513"
msgstr "There. Just above the grate."

msgid "stage102-large.514"
msgstr "I'd better leave it alone."

msgid "stage102-large.515"
msgstr "No, I put it there for a reason."

msgid "stage102-large.516"
msgstr "It's strong, I think it'll hold."

