msgstr "It lead's to the lobby."

msgid "stage103-large.502"
msgstr "Better not. I could get my coat dirty."

msgid "stage103-large.503"
msgstr "It's full of grease."

msgid "stage103-large.504"
msgstr "Empty. Not a single drop left. These monsters are really heavy drinkers."

msgid "stage103-large.505"
msgstr "I think the Shrinking Man was using it as a water bed."

msgid "stage103-large.506"
msgstr "It leads to the gardens."

msgid "stage103-large.507"
msgstr "I'll take him or else he may end up in the garbage bin along with all the other leftovers from the party."

msgid "stage103-large.508"
msgstr "Well! I'll be damned if it isn't the Incredible Shrinking Man!"

msgid "stage103-large.509"
msgstr "He's sleeping it off. Last night's party must have been awesome."

msgid "stage103-large.510"
msgstr "And you say that you found it in the warehouse?"

msgid "stage103-large.511"
msgstr "Yes, I went to the warehouse for a bottle of wine and there it was lying on the ground behind some barrels."

msgid "stage103-large.512"
msgstr "I was sure it was one of those damn zombies. Last night, with all the mess of the party, somebody must have gotten in my pantry, took it ..."

msgid "stage103-large.513"
msgstr "... then hid it in the callars and then forgot to pick it up."

msgid "stage103-large.514"
msgstr "This will go great with our fricasee!"

msgid "stage103-large.515"
msgstr "Elmer, Merci mon ami. I've looking all over for it! I'll store it in the pantry and go get some rest ..."

msgid "stage103-large.516"
msgstr "... I believe I've earned it after all that happened last night. Bon soir!"

msgid "stage103-large.517"
msgstr "Sweet dreams, Francois!"

msgid "stage103-large.518"
msgstr "It's a bit disgusting, but I don't have a choice ..."

msgid "stage103-large.519"
msgstr "Done! I hope it's goo doesn't leave stains on my coat. I have a reputation to maintain."

