msgstr "The plaque says it's by Michelangelo, “The patient man of Ulm”. "

msgid "stage104-large.508"
msgstr "There's a huge scary looking dude in the way. I'm not suicidal."

msgid "stage104-large.509"
msgstr "It leads upstairs but the bouncer is blocking the passage."

msgid "stage104-large.510"
msgstr "No one behind."

msgid "stage104-large.511"
msgstr "Full of leftovers from the party."

msgid "stage104-large.512"
msgstr "With the way he looks, I really doubt he can talk right now and ..."

msgid "stage104-large.513"
msgstr "... I don't want to be the one who wakes him up."

msgid "stage104-large.514"
msgstr "He just sits there to prevent people from going upstairs."

msgid "stage104-large.515"
msgstr "It's loose."

msgid "stage104-large.516"
msgstr "It's not necessary, it's loose."

