msgid "stage106-large.526"
msgstr "Hi, my name is Ashman, Ron Ashman and I work for The Quill."

msgid "stage106-large.527"
msgstr "Hello, reporter! How can I help you?"

msgid "stage106-large.528"
msgstr "Hello doctor."

msgid "stage106-large.529"
msgstr "Hi, how's it going?"

msgid "stage106-large.530"
msgstr "How was the party? Did you notice anything strange about it?"

msgid "stage106-large.531"
msgstr "The party was great, although almost everyone has already left ..."

msgid "stage106-large.532"
msgstr "... and as for strange, well, I don't think there's anything more bizarre than Hannover's annual party right here."

msgid "stage106-large.533"
msgstr "One can always meet interesting monsters ..."

msgid "stage106-large.534"
msgstr "... I met the Cockroach Woman tonight and I'm really looking forward to rubbing her antennae this evening, if you get me."

msgid "stage106-large.535"
msgstr "Have you met a colleague of mine from The Quill?"

msgid "stage106-large.536"
msgstr "No, I'm afraid not."

msgid "stage106-large.537"
msgstr "I hear you're thinking of getting behind the camera."

msgid "stage106-large.538"
msgstr "Yes, although my experiments in the lab take a lot of my time, one day I'd like to see how it feels to be on the other side of the camera."

msgid "stage106-large.539"
msgstr "I'm tired of “Dr. Fly”, “The Return of Dr. Fly”, “Revenge of Dr. Fly” and the like. You fly around the sets as much as I have and at some point it gets really boring."

msgid "stage106-large.540"
msgstr "I've always wondered how your head got to be this way."

msgid "stage106-large.541"
msgstr "A failed experiment ..."

msgid "stage106-large.542"
msgstr "... A major miscalculation with the teleporters I had just invented in my lab."

msgid "stage106-large.543"
msgstr "Nowadays I'm putting the finishing touches to my latest invention."

msgid "stage106-large.544"
msgstr "What's that dripping from your mouth?"

msgid "stage106-large.545"
msgstr "Oh, it's nothing ..."

msgid "stage106-large.546"
msgstr "... just some salivary acids that help me to digest what I eat."

msgid "stage106-large.547"
msgstr "It took me a while to get used to them at first, because they gave me acid reflux ..."

msgid "stage106-large.548"
msgstr "... but now I can't live without them."

msgid "stage106-large.549"
msgstr "It's the only way I can digest food any more."

msgid "stage106-large.550"
msgstr "Nice talking to you, but I have to leave now."

msgid "stage106-large.551"
msgstr "So long, pal."

msgid "stage106-large.552"
msgstr "What is it?"

msgid "stage106-large.553"
msgstr "A device capable of controlling the atmospheric pressure and precipitation ..."

msgid "stage106-large.554"
msgstr "... I've got good results with rainfalls, but the weather control still needs some adjustments."

msgid "stage106-large.555"
msgstr "Hi, I'm Ron Ashman of The Quill. Sorry for the interruption."

msgid "stage106-large.556"
msgstr "Ah, the press! No pictures, please ..."

msgid "stage106-large.557"
msgstr "... You are rather late, the party is over."

msgid "stage106-large.558"
msgstr "Hello again."

msgid "stage106-large.559"
msgstr "Hello, what's up?"

msgid "stage106-large.560"
msgstr "Did you notice anything strange about the party last night?"

msgid "stage106-large.561"
msgstr "Now that you mention it, something weird did happen last night ..."

msgid "stage106-large.562"
msgstr "... A waiter handed me a note from my good friend Frankie, which said to meet him in the warehouse ..."

msgid "stage106-large.563"
msgstr "... At that time I was dancing with a breathtaking redhead so naturally it took me a while to get there ..."

msgid "stage106-large.564"
msgstr "... But when I finally got to the warehouse nobody was there and I didn't get to see Frankie at all that night. I don't know what was that about."

msgid "stage106-large.565"
msgstr "Well, I guess he wanted to tell me about some of those crazy experiments of his."

msgid "stage106-large.566"
msgstr "Did you see a colleague of mine at the party, Sue Bergman?"

msgid "stage106-large.567"
msgstr "I don't remember seeing anyone from The Quill in the party. But hey, no one ever remembers seeing me either."

msgid "stage106-large.568"
msgstr "I've always wondered... How do you shave?"

msgid "stage106-large.569"
msgstr "Very funny, man."

msgid "stage106-large.570"
msgstr "I won't bother you anymore, goodbye!"

msgid "stage106-large.571"
msgstr "Goodbye!"

msgid "stage106-large.572"
msgstr "May I see that note?"

msgid "stage106-large.573"
msgstr "Sure, here it is ..."

msgid "stage106-large.574"
msgstr "Do you remember the waiter that handed you the note?"

msgid "stage106-large.575"
msgstr "Not very well, but it was a skinny guy with a wrinkled face."

msgid "stage106-large.576"
msgstr "That's interesting, but going back to what we talked before ..."

msgid "stage106-large.577"
msgstr "Yes, tell me ..."

