msgstr "There's a sign hanging."

msgid "stage107-large.501"
msgstr "It leads to the kitchen."

msgid "stage107-large.502"
msgstr "I can't, it's locked."

msgid "stage107-large.503"
msgstr "The Ghost of Aldourie Castle. Nobody can play the role of the stereotypical castle ghost like him ..."

msgid "stage107-large.504"
msgstr "... but otherwise, he's completely boring."

msgid "stage107-large.505"
msgstr "It seems the musicians from last night left it behind."

msgid "stage107-large.506"
msgstr "It's used to adjust the height the microphone."

msgid "stage107-large.507"
msgstr "As I understand it, an actor is highly respected by his peers for ..."

msgid "stage107-large.508"
msgstr "... his ability to jump from one role to another."

msgid "stage107-large.509"
msgstr "He seems content."

msgid "stage107-large.510"
msgstr "I've always wanted to play the drums."

msgid "stage107-large.511"
msgstr "I'd love to, but I think I might create a panic."

msgid "stage107-large.512"
msgstr "It doesn't look like something I might need later."

msgid "stage107-large.513"
msgstr "It says:"

msgid "stage107-large.514"
msgstr "“I'll be out for a while. For any enquiries please talk to Joseph.”"

msgid "stage107-large.515"
msgstr "Singed: Francois"

msgid "stage107-large.516"
msgstr "Impossible. It's linked to the Ghost and the heavy ball."

msgid "stage107-large.517"
msgstr "It chains the Ghost's ankle to one of those heavy lead balls."

msgid "stage107-large.518"
msgstr "It must weigh a ton."

msgid "stage107-large.519"
msgstr "The saw almost broke but I just managed to cut it."

msgid "stage107-large.520"
msgstr "Well, that's the rope of the bell. Let's see what you can do."

msgid "stage107-large.521"
msgstr "Now Quasimodo will demonstrate ..."

msgid "stage107-large.522"
msgstr "These American bells sound very strange!"

msgid "stage107-large.523"
msgstr "I have to agree, they do sound strange. Anyway, I'm impressed, my friend."

msgid "stage107-large.524"
msgstr "Thanks for the demonstration, I'll never doubt you again."

msgid "stage107-large.525"
msgstr "Okay, back to the party."

msgid "stage107-large.526"
msgstr "Hello, Mr. McDundee. I'm Ron Ashman of The Quill."

msgid "stage107-large.527"
msgstr "Hello, Mr. Ashman. I thought there were no longer any journalists here."

msgid "stage107-large.528"
msgstr "Hello again, Mr. McDundee."

msgid "stage107-large.529"
msgstr "What can I do for you, Mr. Ashman?"

msgid "stage107-large.530"
msgstr "What can you tell me about your future projects?"

msgid "stage107-large.531"
msgstr "Oh, I'm very excited because I get to play a wide variety of roles in my upcoming films ..."

msgid "stage107-large.532"
msgstr "... “The Spirit of Gruham” ..."

msgid "stage107-large.533"
msgstr "... “Have you seen the Spirit of Kruberry?”..."

msgid "stage107-large.534"
msgstr "... “The illegitimate son of the Highfield Spirit” ..."

msgid "stage107-large.535"
msgstr "People say I have a good head on my shoulders but it's difficult with so many roles to keep my head straight, and really putting my head down on so many different roles can give me a headache."

msgid "stage107-large.536"
msgstr "Yeah, well, I see. They sound great, nevertheless."

msgid "stage107-large.537"
msgstr "It seems that almost everyone last night had one glass too many ..."

msgid "stage107-large.538"
msgstr "Bah, these monsters don't even know what it trully means to drink ..."

msgid "stage107-large.539"
msgstr "... If they tried even a sip of my special cocktail, the “Nessie Boom”, they'd black out instantly."

msgid "stage107-large.540"
msgstr "Tell me about yourself. You were born in Scotland, right?"

msgid "stage107-large.541"
msgstr "Of course, lad. My hometown, Inverness, stands very close to the famous Loch Ness ..."

msgid "stage107-large.542"
msgstr "...  in the most beautiful part of Scotland."

msgid "stage107-large.543"
msgstr "Let's talk again about this cocktail of your, this “Nessie Boom”."

msgid "stage107-large.544"
msgstr "What do you want to know, lad?"

msgid "stage107-large.545"
msgstr "Thanks for everything, Mr. McDundee. Bye!"

msgid "stage107-large.546"
msgstr "Goodbye!"

msgid "stage107-large.547"
msgstr "Did you invent the “Nessie Boom” by yourself?"

msgid "stage107-large.548"
msgstr "No, it was invented by my great-grandfather, John McDundee ..."

msgid "stage107-large.549"
msgstr "... He invented it over 500 years ago in order to calm Nessie down, you know, the famous Loch Ness monster."

msgid "stage107-large.550"
msgstr "Can you tell me how to prepare a strong “Nessie Boom”?"

msgid "stage107-large.551"
msgstr "Impossible, lad. The three ingredients of the “Nessie Boom” are a family secret, which is only passed down from father to son."

msgid "stage107-large.552"
msgstr "Only a member of the clan McDundee can know the secret."

msgid "stage107-large.553"
msgstr "And is it really as strong as you say?"

msgid "stage107-large.554"
msgstr "You can bet it is."

msgid "stage107-large.555"
msgstr "A sip of my “Nessie Boom” and heads start spinning."

msgid "stage107-large.556"
msgstr "Maybe you could teach me how to prepare the cocktail ..."

msgid "stage107-large.557"
msgstr "I'm afraid not, lad."

msgid "stage107-large.558"
msgstr "Only one of pure Scottish lineage could do it."

msgid "stage107-large.559"
msgstr "Well, let's talk about something else."

msgid "stage107-large.560"
msgstr "As you wish."

msgid "stage107-large.561"
msgstr "And what this cocktail of yours looks like?"

msgid "stage107-large.562"
msgstr "You see, lad, the real “Nessie Boom” has a light blue color which can only be compared to that of the Scottish sky ..."

msgid "stage107-large.563"
msgstr "... in the rare days when the sun shines through, of course."

msgid "stage107-large.564"
msgstr "Hi, my name is Ashman, Ron Ashman and I'm a reporter for The Quill."

msgid "stage107-large.565"
msgstr "Hello."

msgid "stage107-large.566"
msgstr "Hello, Quasimodo."

msgid "stage107-large.567"
msgstr "Hello again."

msgid "stage107-large.568"
msgstr "Any chance you've seen Sue Bergman at the party? She's a colleague of mine from the newspaper."

msgid "stage107-large.569"
msgstr "No, Quasimodo haven't heard ..."

msgid "stage107-large.570"
msgstr "... eh Quasimodo haven't seen this colleague of your."

msgid "stage107-large.571"
msgstr "Did you notice anything unusual at the party?"

msgid "stage107-large.572"
msgstr "Unusual?"

msgid "stage107-large.573"
msgstr "The strangest thing Quasimodo saw at the party was the Creature from the Black Lagoon leading a conga line of over a hundred people."

msgid "stage107-large.574"
msgstr "I haven't seen you in a lot of movies lately."

msgid "stage107-large.575"
msgstr "The truth is that Quasimondo isn't much interested in the scripts he gets lately."

msgid "stage107-large.576"
msgstr "What Quasimodo likes the most is pulling the ropes to ring the bells ..."

msgid "stage107-large.577"
msgstr "... Do you know that nobody else, but Quasimodo himself, is able to pull the bells of Notre Dame without any help?"

msgid "stage107-large.578"
msgstr "I have to leave, see ya."

msgid "stage107-large.579"
msgstr "Bye."

msgid "stage107-large.580"
msgstr "It must have been quite a spectacle."

msgid "stage107-large.581"
msgstr "Of course, Quasimodo will never forget the beautiful Chloe West dancing with all those monsters at the party."

msgid "stage107-large.582"
msgstr "It must be hard."

msgid "stage107-large.583"
msgstr "It is. It took Quasimodo many years of practice ..."

msgid "stage107-large.584"
msgstr "... but now no one is better than Quasimodo in pulling ropes."

msgid "stage107-large.585"
msgstr "You say no one else is able without help? I can't believe that!"

msgid "stage107-large.586"
msgstr "It's true, Quasimodo never lies."

msgid "stage107-large.587"
msgstr "So you say it's more than just raw strength, right?"

msgid "stage107-large.588"
msgstr "Of course, you also need style. And that is why Quasimodo is the best."

msgid "stage107-large.589"
msgstr "Quasimodo has performed in all the great cathedrals of Europe."

msgid "stage107-large.590"
msgstr "And speaking of something else."

msgid "stage107-large.591"
msgstr "Yes?"

msgid "stage107-large.592"
msgstr "I'd really like to see you in action. How about a little demonstration?"

msgid "stage107-large.593"
msgstr "Happy to, but Quasimodo can't see any bells around."

msgid "stage107-large.594"
msgstr "Well, I just happen to know one around here ..."

msgid "stage107-large.595"
msgstr "... You see, the American bells are somewhat different from the ones you're familiar with."

msgid "stage107-large.596"
msgstr "Great. Qusimodo will go there and Quasimodo will give demonstration."

