msgid "stage108-large.500"
msgstr "No one can honestly say that Francois keeps a clean kitchen."

msgid "stage108-large.501"
msgstr "It leads back to the ballroom."

msgid "stage108-large.502"
msgstr "Francois is blocking my passage."

msgid "stage108-large.503"
msgstr "Every kitchen worth its salt has to have a good pantry."

msgid "stage108-large.504"
msgstr "He's the cook."

msgid "stage108-large.505"
msgstr "He's French, obviously."

msgid "stage108-large.506"
msgstr "Nothing interesting there. They're full of canned food."

msgid "stage108-large.507"
msgstr "I'd bet they're full of canned food."

msgid "stage108-large.508"
msgstr "No way! I don't know what it is but I won't even touch it."

msgid "stage108-large.509"
msgstr "I may not know what it is, but I know that I don't like it."

msgid "stage108-large.510"
msgstr "I'm not interested in cans."

msgid "stage108-large.511"
msgstr "Full of canned food ..."

msgid "stage108-large.512"
msgstr "... it doesn't look like Francois is doing much cooking after all."

msgid "stage108-large.513"
msgstr "I wouldn't want to be in the shoes of the person who will have to clean this mess."

msgid "stage108-large.514"
msgstr "Sniff, sniff ..."

msgid "stage108-large.515"
msgstr "... something smells like ..."

msgid "stage108-large.516"
msgstr "A brave man this Francois ..."

msgid "stage108-large.517"
msgstr "... and dedicated to his work, I must say."

msgid "stage108-large.518"
msgstr "GAS!!!"

msgid "stage108-large.519"
msgstr "Run for your lives!"

msgid "stage108-large.520"
msgstr "Good morning, I'm Ron Ashman.\t"

msgid "stage108-large.521"
msgstr "Another health inspection???"

msgid "stage108-large.522"
msgstr "I told you already, I don't let Dr. Fly come in here."

msgid "stage108-large.523"
msgstr "As you can see everything is clean here, so let me do my job."

msgid "stage108-large.524"
msgstr "Good morning."

msgid "stage108-large.525"
msgstr "You again? ..."

msgid "stage108-large.526"
msgstr "... Can't you see that I haven't finished sweeping yet?"

msgid "stage108-large.527"
msgstr "I'm not here to inspect anything really, I'm just looking for something."

msgid "stage108-large.528"
msgstr "Well, as you can see, I have a lot of work to do, so leave me alone."

msgid "stage108-large.529"
msgstr "What was on the menu for the party?"

msgid "stage108-large.530"
msgstr "Let me see ..."

msgid "stage108-large.531"
msgstr "... I've had to prepare delicious dishes for all the monsters ..."

msgid "stage108-large.532"
msgstr "... from hearts filled with bile, up to bat placenta canapes ..."

msgid "stage108-large.533"
msgstr "... not to mention the delicious fresh blood cream with eyeballs on top."

msgid "stage108-large.534"
msgstr "The kitchen is quite dirty, Francois, wouldn't you say?"

msgid "stage108-large.535"
msgstr "That's not true monsieur. It has that very old and neglected look that gives it that necessary dramatic flair ..."

msgid "stage108-large.536"
msgstr "... In fact it's so clean you could eat directly from the floor without any problems."

msgid "stage108-large.537"
msgstr "What's in the pantry?"

msgid "stage108-large.538"
msgstr "That's none of your business, monsieur!"

msgid "stage108-large.539"
msgstr "In this kitchen I'm the boss, so you'd best keep your nose out of my business."

msgid "stage108-large.540"
msgstr "I'll leave you to your sweeping, I have to go."

msgid "stage108-large.541"
msgstr "Tres bien, else I'd have thrown you out myself."

msgid "stage108-large.542"
msgstr "And you didn't prepare anything with brains?"

msgid "stage108-large.543"
msgstr "Of courese I did! ..."

msgid "stage108-large.544"
msgstr "... My famous rare medium brains kebab a la “Francois” ..."

msgid "stage108-large.545"
msgstr "... a cake with cerebellum and blueberries ..."

msgid "stage108-large.546"
msgstr "... and the lungs “Surprise” stuffed with minced brains with hypothalamus sauce on the side."

msgid "stage108-large.547"
msgstr "Is there any chance you used Frankenstein's brain for a dish in the menu?"

msgid "stage108-large.548"
msgstr "Do you think that every brain that I cook comes with a designation of origin, monsieur?"

msgid "stage108-large.549"
msgstr "I'm just happy to even have enough for my meals!"

msgid "stage108-large.550"
msgstr "Let's change the subject."

msgid "stage108-large.551"
msgstr "Fine by me ..."

msgid "stage108-large.552"
msgstr "Why don't you disappear?"

msgid "stage108-large.553"
msgstr "I need to go in the pantry."

msgid "stage108-large.554"
msgstr "And I need a much bigger kitchen ..."

msgid "stage108-large.555"
msgstr "... and many helpers ..."

msgid "stage108-large.556"
msgstr "... and a new set of knives ..."

msgid "stage108-large.557"
msgstr "Do you think cooking in these conditions is easy for me?"

msgid "stage108-large.558"
msgstr "You see, I dropped my wallet in there ..."

msgid "stage108-large.559"
msgstr "Don't insult my intelligence, monsieur. I'm the only one with access to the pantry."

msgid "stage108-large.560"
msgstr "The future of all humanity depends on me finding what I'm looking for."

msgid "stage108-large.561"
msgstr "Frankly ..."

msgid "stage108-large.562"
msgstr "... you don't strike me as a person who can save the future of humanity."

msgid "stage108-large.563"
msgstr "It's very stuffy in here, why don't you go out for a while and get some fresh air?"

msgid "stage108-large.564"
msgstr "Not a chance. I'm like a captain who never abandons his ship no matter what."

