msgstr "The famous Loch Ness! ..."

msgid "stage801-large.501"
msgstr "... I've always wanted to visit this area."

msgid "stage801-large.502"
msgstr "He doesn't look like someone who will ever have stress problems."

msgid "stage801-large.503"
msgstr "It's quite small ..."

msgid "stage801-large.504"
msgstr "... it sure wasn't made for high seas fishing."

msgid "stage801-large.505"
msgstr "No way! I don't think that boat can support both of our weights."

msgid "stage801-large.506"
msgstr "I don't think there's anything interesting there."

msgid "stage801-large.507"
msgstr "It looks like an ancient abbey."

msgid "stage801-large.508"
