msgid "stage801-large.511"
msgstr "Hello and good morning. Your face seems familiar ..."

msgid "stage801-large.512"
msgstr "Oh, really? I don't know... My name is Graeme McDundee."

msgid "stage801-large.513"
msgstr "Hello cousin."

msgid "stage801-large.514"
msgstr "Hello."

msgid "stage801-large.515"
msgstr "How lucky to have found you!"

msgid "stage801-large.516"
msgstr "My name is McDundee... Ron McDundee ..."

msgid "stage801-large.517"
msgstr "... your cousin from America."

msgid "stage801-large.518"
msgstr "Cousin???"

msgid "stage801-large.519"
msgstr "I didn't know I had a cousin in America ..."

msgid "stage801-large.520"
msgstr "My parents moved there when I was just a wee lad but I never forgot my beloved Scotland."

msgid "stage801-large.521"
msgstr "You don't look a bit Scottish."

msgid "stage801-large.522"
msgstr "It's all because of the American fast food ..."

msgid "stage801-large.523"
msgstr "I came back because I want to keep the tradition of the clan alive ..."

msgid "stage801-large.524"
msgstr "... and that's why I want you to tell me the ingredients for a “Nessie Boom” cocktail."

msgid "stage801-large.525"
msgstr "How come you don't know them if you are of the clan of McDundee?"

msgid "stage801-large.526"
msgstr "Well ..."

msgid "stage801-large.527"
msgstr "... just before reaching America there was a storm, and my parents fell overboard without previously entrusting me with their great secret."

msgid "stage801-large.528"
msgstr "It was terrible for me!"

msgid "stage801-large.529"
msgstr "Okay, I'll tell you the ingredients if you can prove to me that you belong to the clan McDundee and you know our family tree."

msgid "stage801-large.530"
msgstr "I'll ask you three questions to which only an impostor would fail to answer."

msgid "stage801-large.531"
msgstr "Agreed."

msgid "stage801-large.532"
msgstr "No, that's not right."

msgid "stage801-large.533"
msgstr "You can't be a true McDundee ..."

msgid "stage801-large.534"
msgstr "... please go away and let me fish in peace."

msgid "stage801-large.535"
msgstr "Correct. On to the next question."

msgid "stage801-large.536"
msgstr "Excellent! Now for the last one."

msgid "stage801-large.537"
msgstr "There's no doubt, you are a true McDundee!"

msgid "stage801-large.538"
msgstr "Well, I never doubted you, I can see it in your eyes ..."

msgid "stage801-large.539"
msgstr "... I'll tell you now what you want to know."

msgid "stage801-large.540"
msgstr "The three ingredients for a good “Nessie Boom” are:"

msgid "stage801-large.541"
msgstr "A dash of milk ..."

msgid "stage801-large.542"
msgstr "... three fingers of grog ..."

msgid "stage801-large.543"
msgstr "... and finally, half a bottle of good Scotch whiskey."

msgid "stage801-large.544"
msgstr "Cousin, can you tell me how to prepare a “Nessie Boom”?"

msgid "stage801-large.545"
msgstr "Thank you, cousin, I'll leave you to your fishing."

msgid "stage801-large.546"
msgstr "Forget it, come back later ..."

