msgid "stage802-large.500"
msgstr "A nest! ...\t"

msgid "stage802-large.501"
msgstr "... and judging by its size it couldn't belong to a seagull."

msgid "stage802-large.502"
msgstr "I can't take the egg with me, I haven't fallen so low."

msgid "stage802-large.503"
msgstr "It belongs here."

msgid "stage802-large.504"
msgstr "It leads to the lake shore."

msgid "stage802-large.505"
msgstr "I wonder what kind of bird built such a big nest."

msgid "stage802-large.506"
msgstr "Something is moving up there. The chick could hatch any minute now."

msgid "stage802-large.507"
msgstr "I can't do that, you have to let nature take its course."

msgid "stage802-large.508"
msgstr "I can't do that."

msgid "stage802-large.509"
msgstr "It's hungry."

msgid "stage802-large.510"
msgstr "Maybe this hat can give it the warmth it needs ..."

msgid "stage802-large.511"
msgstr "I'll place the helmet in the nest."

msgid "stage802-large.512"
msgstr "Wow!... It didn't even take a minute."

msgid "stage802-large.513"
msgstr "Look at how cute is is."

msgid "stage802-large.514"
msgstr "I don't think this is the right kind of food to feed to a chick."

msgid "stage901-large.500"
msgstr "The Quill!"

msgid "stage901-large.501"
msgstr "The Quill! The Quill!"

msgid "stage901-large.502"
msgstr "Extra!"

msgid "stage901-large.503"
msgstr "Extra, extra! Read all about it!"

msgid "stage901-large.504"
msgstr "This is the night of the “Hollywood Monsters”!"

msgid "stage901-large.505"
msgstr "All the details inside!"

msgid "stage910-large.500"
msgstr "Linda! Call Ashman and Bergman and tell them to meet me in my office."

msgid "stage910-large.501"
msgstr "Hey, boss! You called?"

msgid "stage910-large.502"
msgstr "Yes, Ashman. By the way, good job on your Newman jewelry heist article ..."

msgid "stage910-large.503"
msgstr "... It's a shame The New Post beat you to it by a day."

msgid "stage910-large.504"
msgstr "Well, boss. I didn't know about it ..."

msgid "stage910-large.505"
msgstr "Okay, okay, forget it ..."

msgid "stage910-large.506"
msgstr "... I suppose you know that tonight is the night of the “Hollywood Monsters” ..."

msgid "stage910-large.507"
msgstr "... The annual Film Academy awards ceremony for monster actors."

msgid "stage910-large.508"
msgstr "Ah, yes! Great story there ..."

msgid "stage910-large.509"
msgstr "It'll be held in Otto Hannover's mansion, who's the billionaire owner of M.K.O. studios."

msgid "stage910-large.510"
msgstr "The cream of the crop of the movie scene will be there tonight."

msgid "stage910-large.511"
msgstr "I hate those parties with all those stiff neck pretenders!"

msgid "stage910-large.512"
msgstr "Well, I'm sorry, but it's either you or Bergman. I need someone to cover the story ..."

msgid "stage910-large.513"
msgstr "... do a couple of interviews ..."

msgid "stage910-large.514"
msgstr "... and keep his ears to the ground for any gossip circulating in the party ..."

msgid "stage910-large.515"
msgstr "... you know, the typical."

msgid "stage910-large.516"
msgstr "Pick Sue, boss. I'm not a journalist for parties and celebrity goosip."

msgid "stage910-large.517"
msgstr "I don't give a damn. All I know is that you don't wanna go and that Sue is nowhere to be found."

msgid "stage910-large.518"
msgstr "Hi, boss! Sorry I'm late."

msgid "stage910-large.519"
msgstr "Tonight is the night of the “Hollywood Monsters” and we must cover the news ..."

msgid "stage910-large.520"
msgstr "... but don't bother, I'm going ..."

msgid "stage910-large.521"
msgstr "... We need our top reporter on this story."

msgid "stage910-large.522"
msgstr "Boss! What's the meaning of this?"

msgid "stage910-large.523"
msgstr "A woman can mingle much better in this kind of party ..."

msgid "stage910-large.524"
msgstr "... not to mention that Ashman hasn't once in his life been to a party that wasn't held in the back alley of a street."

msgid "stage910-large.525"
msgstr "On the other hand, I've attended high society parties all my life and I've learned to fit in like a fish in the water. This story is mine!"

msgid "stage910-large.526"
msgstr "The signature on the article will say Bergman, not Ashman."

msgid "stage910-large.527"
msgstr "Okay, okay, decide it among yourselves. "

msgid "stage910-large.528"
msgstr "Well, boss, perhaps Sue is right and I'm not suitable for the occasion ..."

msgid "stage910-large.529"
msgstr "Well, Ron, don't take it personally. I didn't want to offend you ..."

msgid "stage910-large.530"
msgstr "Don't worry, don't worry, I'm okay ..."

msgid "stage910-large.531"
msgstr "It's decided then. Bergman, you go to the party and I'll hold the front-page. Now get the hell outta here, both of you."

msgid "stage910-large.532"
msgstr "Don't worry, boss. With the interviews I'll get, The Quill will need to make an extra edition tomorrow."

msgid "stage910-large.533"
msgstr "Did you call for me?"

msgid "stage910-large.534"
msgstr "Whaaaat?"

msgid "stage910-large.535"
msgstr "Ron, have you heard from Bergman?"

msgid "stage910-large.536"
msgstr "Not me, boss. Why?"

msgid "stage910-large.537"
msgstr "I haven't heard from her since she left yesterday for the party at Hannover's mansion."

msgid "stage910-large.538"
msgstr "I arrived this morning and there's no trace of either her or her article."

msgid "stage910-large.539"
msgstr "I called her home but nobody answered."

msgid "stage910-large.540"
msgstr "Do you think something happened to her?"

msgid "stage910-large.541"
msgstr "I dunno boss. Truth be told it does sound strange."

msgid "stage910-large.542"
msgstr "Sue wouldn't abandon a story for no good reason."

msgid "stage910-large.543"
msgstr "Good, I want you go to Hanover's mansion and have a look around. See what you can come up with."

msgid "stage910-large.544"
msgstr "I agree, boss. I'll go immediately."

msgid "stage910-large.545"
msgstr "Great, keep me informed."

msgid "stage910-large.546"
msgstr "Well, guys, I have to admit that this time you did a great job."

msgid "stage910-large.547"
msgstr "Thanks, boss.. Once again, I was awesome!"

msgid "stage910-large.548"
msgstr "You???"

msgid "stage910-large.549"
msgstr "Sorry, babe, but I wonder if you realize that if it weren't for me ..."

msgid "stage910-large.550"
msgstr "... you'd be displayed in the museum by now."

msgid "stage910-large.551"
msgstr "Don't you even try to take all the credit now ..."

msgid "stage910-large.552"
msgstr "... I was the one who first tried to unravel this mystery ..."

msgid "stage910-large.553"
msgstr "Great, great, don't start arguing again."

msgid "stage910-large.554"
msgstr "I never thought I'd say this, but you two make a great team."

msgid "stage910-large.555"
msgstr "Team?"

msgid "stage910-large.556"
msgstr "Team?"

msgid "stage910-large.557"
msgstr "Of course, and I just happened to have the perfect assignment ..."

msgid "stage910-large.558"
msgstr "... for my new best team."

msgid "stage910-large.559"
msgstr "Take the rest of the day off and I want to see you early tomorrow morning ready for THE NEXT BIG THING!"

msgid "stage911-large.500"
msgstr "Arh, arh, arh, arh, arh...rrrrr...!"

msgid "stage911-large.501"
msgstr "...grrrrr...grrrrr...arh!"

msgid "stage911-large.502"
msgstr "Grrrr...arh, arh, arh, arh, arh, arh...!"

msgid "stage911-large.503"
msgstr "...GRRRRRRRR...ARH...ARH...GRRRRR...GRRR...!"

msgid "stage911-large.504"
msgstr "...grrrrrr... grrrrr!"

msgid "stage911-large.505"
msgstr "I understand that you had some disagreements with the director of your latest film?"

msgid "stage911-large.506"
msgstr "I see, I see ..."

msgid "stage911-large.507"
msgstr "... there're some directors who don't allow their actors ..."

msgid "stage911-large.508"
msgstr "... to add any type of personal touch and flair to their role."

msgid "stage911-large.509"
msgstr "And speaking of something else, is it true that you recently got your fifth divorce?"

msgid "stage911-large.510"
msgstr "I see you took it the wrong way ..."

msgid "stage911-large.511"
msgstr "... what I mean is, you don't have to climb a skyscraper every time you got a date hoping this time it'll end well."

msgid "stage912-large.500"
msgstr "Well, It may not be so bad to have an assistant, after all."

msgid "stage912-large.501"
msgstr "Assistant? You're dreaming, Ashman!"

msgid "stage912-large.502"
msgstr "Your imagination is running wild again, like that time ..."

msgid "stage912-large.503"
msgstr "... you thought you had a close encounter with an alien and it tuned out to be a hoax."

msgid "stage912-large.504"
msgstr "Yeah, look who's talking, like you're never wrong ..."

msgid "stage912-large.505"
msgstr "... then what about the time you brought this exclusive interview with the President and ..."

msgid "stage912-large.506"
msgstr "... it turned out to be a dock worker who did imitations with his voice in the local pubs? ..."

msgid "stage912-large.507"
msgstr "That's not what happened and you know it, what happened is ..."

msgid "stage913-large.500"
msgstr "How is it going, doc?"

msgid "stage913-large.501"
msgstr "Everything's going according to plan, don't worry."

msgid "stage913-large.502"
msgstr "There's a journalist who's snooping around, asking questions about the girl, which  ..."

msgid "stage913-large.503"
msgstr "... can be a problem, we must be cautious."

msgid "stage913-large.504"
msgstr "What are you going to do with her? I think we should get rid of her ..."

msgid "stage913-large.505"
msgstr "Leave it to me, boss. I have something in mind for her ..."

msgid "stage913-large.506"
msgstr "How's it going, doc?"

msgid "stage913-large.507"
msgstr "The plan goes ahead as planned."

msgid "stage913-large.508"
msgstr "Another one's fallen for it."

msgid "stage913-large.509"
msgstr "Wonderful news!"

msgid "stage913-large.510"
msgstr "And what about that reporter?"

msgid "stage913-large.511"
msgstr "He's committed, but for now he doesn't know anything."

msgid "stage913-large.512"
msgstr "Don't worry."

msgid "stage913-large.513"
msgstr "Okay, but he should be closely monitored. We can't take any risks."

msgid "stage913-large.514"
msgstr "What's new, doc?"

msgid "stage913-large.515"
msgstr "Oh yeah, we bagged another one."

msgid "stage913-large.516"
msgstr "I love hearing that."

msgid "stage913-large.517"
msgstr "Soon I'll have absolute control."

msgid "stage913-large.518"
msgstr "I only hope this Ashman guy won't spoil our plans. Do you have any news about him?"

msgid "stage913-large.519"
msgstr "The truth is that he's surprising closer than I thought ..."

msgid "stage913-large.520"
msgstr "... but I won't let him become a problem."

msgid "stage913-large.521"
msgstr "All right doc. I trust you, I know you won't disappoint me."

msgid "stage913-large.522"
msgstr "Doctor, It recently came to my attention that Ashman ..."

msgid "stage913-large.523"
msgstr "... is starting to get dangerously close."

msgid "stage913-large.524"
msgstr "I know. It's time to take care of him."

msgid "stage913-large.525"
msgstr "Meanwhile, I have good news."

msgid "stage913-large.526"
msgstr "One less to worry about!"

msgid "stage913-large.527"
msgstr "Good, very good. The end is near."

msgid "stage913-large.528"
msgstr "Now more than ever we must be very cautious."

msgid "stage913-large.529"
msgstr "We can't allow a two-bit journalist to thwart all our plans ..."

msgid "stage913-large.530"
msgstr "Don't worry! Ron Ashman is history."

msgid "stage920-large.500"
msgstr "Thank you!"

msgid "stage920-large.501"
msgstr "Thank you, my friends!"

msgid "stage920-large.502"
msgstr "I love you all!"

msgid "stage921-large.500"
msgstr "My brothers, I have great news ..."

msgid "stage921-large.501"
msgstr "Yes?"

msgid "stage921-large.502"
msgstr "What?"

msgid "stage921-large.503"
msgstr "I just saw a doctor and he told me when we're getting out of here."

msgid "stage921-large.504"
msgstr "When?"

msgid "stage921-large.505"
msgstr "Yes, when?"

msgid "stage921-large.506"
msgstr "Next week we are discharged."

msgid "stage921-large.507"
msgstr "Great."

msgid "stage921-large.508"
msgstr "Fantastic."

msgid "stage921-large.509"
msgstr "I also thought it would be nice to go and visit our grandparents, the three of us. We haven't seen them in a long time."

msgid "stage921-large.510"
msgstr "That's a great idea!"

msgid "stage921-large.511"
msgstr "Yeah, we will all go together!"

msgid "stage921-large.512"
msgstr "Always together!"

msgid "stage921-large.513"
msgstr "Together and united!"

msgid "stage921-large.514"
msgstr "The Heckers united will never be crushed!"

msgid "stage921-large.515"
msgstr "The Heckers united will never be crushed!"

msgid "stage921-large.516"
msgstr "The Heckers united will never be crushed!"

msgid "stage921-large.517"
msgstr "THE HECKERS UNITED WILL NEVER BE CRUSHED!!!"

msgid "stage921-large.518"
msgstr "Ahhhh... ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha!"

msgid "stage921-large.519"
msgstr "Hi, hi, hi!"

msgid "stage921-large.520"
msgstr "Ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ha, ahhhhhh... ha, ha!"

msgid "stage921-large.521"
msgstr "Well, you had this coming!"

