msgstr "... it's pretty, right?"

msgid "stage602-large.521"
msgstr "Yes, very pretty. I was watching it closely because ..."

msgid "stage602-large.522"
msgstr "... it certainly is gorgeous, eh? Beautiful indeed."

msgid "stage602-large.523"
msgstr "Thanks, it's a gift from Mr. Hannover."

msgid "stage602-large.524"
msgstr "I wanted one so much. It's an absolutely wonderful handbag."

msgid "stage602-large.525"
msgstr "She must be the secretary."

msgid "stage602-large.526"
