msgid "stage602-large.527"
msgstr "Mr. Hannover, there is a reporter here from The Quill, a Mr. hmmm, how was it again? ... Ashman."

msgid "stage602-large.528"
msgstr "He may come in.\t\t\t"

msgid "stage602-large.529"
msgstr "Thanks, sweetheart."

msgid "stage602-large.530"
msgstr "I'd better not drink any coffee ..."

msgid "stage602-large.531"
msgstr "Here, beautiful. Look what I got for you ..."

msgid "stage602-large.532"
msgstr "It's a cute little kitten!"

msgid "stage602-large.533"
msgstr "Nice, thank you very much!"

msgid "stage602-large.534"
msgstr "Poor thing must me hungry. I'll go find some milk for him."

msgid "stage602-large.535"
msgstr "That girl has a big heart. As big as her chest probably!"

msgid "stage602-large.536"
msgstr "No, I prefer mine."

msgid "stage602-large.537"
msgstr "It's a typical office agenda."

msgid "stage602-large.538"
msgstr "Let's see ..."

msgid "stage602-large.539"
msgstr "That looks interesting ..."

msgid "stage602-large.540"
msgstr "... Billy Ford, 555 31 41."

msgid "stage602-large.541"
msgstr "It's very modern ..."

msgid "stage602-large.542"
msgstr "... I prefer the classic models, they have more charm."

msgid "stage602-large.543"
msgstr "I don't need to make any calls."

msgid "stage602-large.544"
msgstr "Great idea!"

msgid "stage602-large.545"
msgstr "I'd like to speak to Billy Ford, please."

msgid "stage602-large.546"
msgstr "Billy? Otto Hannover here ..."

msgid "stage602-large.547"
msgstr "I sound strange? It must be the line ..."

msgid "stage602-large.548"
msgstr "... hey, remember that role for which you wanted a new face? ..."

msgid "stage602-large.549"
msgstr "... I have just what you're looking for."

msgid "stage602-large.550"
msgstr "Yeah, he's a new kid. His name is Charlie Bog, and he's fantastic."

msgid "stage602-large.551"
msgstr "Of course, Billy. Send me the script right now I'll make sure he gets it ..."

msgid "stage602-large.552"
msgstr "Fine by me, send it by courier, whichever is faster. Goodbye!"

msgid "stage602-large.553"
msgstr "I know, Mr. Ford, but Mr. Hanover's instructions are very clear: no unknown actors for the role ..."

msgid "stage602-large.554"
msgstr "... He's not taking any chances. He wants a big star to ensure the box office success ..."

msgid "stage602-large.555"
msgstr "Yes, Mr. Hannover has already informed me that all the artsy stuff are under your jurisdiction, but ..."

msgid "stage602-large.556"
msgstr "... his decision on this is irrevocable. Sorry, Mr. Ford."

msgid "stage602-large.557"
msgstr "Well, You don't have to use that tone with me, Mr. Ford. ...Yes, I'll pass on your message."

msgid "stage602-large.558"
msgstr "I'll bet that Mr. Ford on the phone was the famous director, Billy Ford."

msgid "stage602-large.559"
msgstr "Hello, sweetheart. I'm Ron Ashman, of The Quill."

msgid "stage602-large.560"
msgstr "Hello, I'm Taffy, Mr. Hannover's Secretary."

msgid "stage602-large.561"
msgstr "Hello again, Taffy."

msgid "stage602-large.562"
msgstr "Hi."

msgid "stage602-large.563"
msgstr "Taffy, I'd like to see Mr. Hannover."

msgid "stage602-large.564"
msgstr "Sorry, but Mr. Hanover has ordered me not to let anyone in ..."

msgid "stage602-large.565"
msgstr "... especially you."

msgid "stage602-large.566"
msgstr "What does a girl like you, with those... qualities, doing wasting your time behind a desk ...?"

msgid "stage602-large.567"
msgstr "Well, this work is only temporary, as you can probably imagine."

msgid "stage602-large.568"
msgstr "Actually, I'm an actress. Otto... I mean Mr. Hannover, promised me that if I put everything in his hands, he'd make me a star ..."

msgid "stage602-large.569"
msgstr "So, for the moment, I'm just waiting for the right role to come by, the one that will make me famous ..."

msgid "stage602-large.570"
msgstr "What can you tell me about your boss?"

msgid "stage602-large.571"
msgstr "Oh, he's a great man ..."

msgid "stage602-large.572"
msgstr "... and he's very kind to me.  When I go to work in his mansion during the weekends, he always insists that I drop everything and rehearse with him to polish my ..."

msgid "stage602-large.573"
msgstr "... artistic skills."

msgid "stage602-large.574"
msgstr "Why do you use a magnifying lens?"

msgid "stage602-large.575"
msgstr "Well, you see, I have one tiny little problem with my eyesight ..."

msgid "stage602-large.576"
msgstr "... nothing serious, you know, so it's not even worth wearing glasses for it."

msgid "stage602-large.577"
msgstr "With the magnifying glass, I can see just fine."

msgid "stage602-large.578"
msgstr "I don't want anything else, baby. See you ..."

msgid "stage602-large.579"
msgstr "Okay, see you soon!"

msgid "stage602-large.580"
msgstr "Wow, that's great! I'm sure one day you'll be a big star ..."

msgid "stage602-large.581"
msgstr "... and in the meantime, you can definitely provide your great services to Mr. Hannover ..."

msgid "stage602-large.582"
msgstr "Yes, exactly right. Thank you!"

msgid "stage602-large.583"
msgstr "I'm sure you're a great lover ..."

msgid "stage602-large.584"
msgstr "... of cinema."

msgid "stage602-large.585"
msgstr "Yes, there're only two things in this life that I love passionately ..."

msgid "stage602-large.586"
msgstr "... cinema and my cat, Renato."

msgid "stage602-large.587"
msgstr "That's fine, Taffy, but let's talk about something else ..."

msgid "stage602-large.588"
msgstr "As you wish ..."

