msgstr "No. Hannover can enter at any time."

msgid "stage603-large.504"
msgstr "I think it's the one Steve Reiner used in “The 98th Street Blues”."

msgid "stage603-large.505"
msgstr "It's not a good time to practice."

msgid "stage603-large.506"
msgstr "He sounds like he hasn't finished emptying his bowels yet."

msgid "stage603-large.507"
msgstr "I can't, Hannover is inside."

msgid "stage603-large.508"
msgstr "No way! I won't even go near that coffee."

msgid "stage603-large.509"
msgstr "It seems that this type of daisy is really effective."

msgid "stage603-large.510"
msgstr "Better not, golf isn't my thing."

msgid "stage603-large.511"
msgstr "It wouldn't hurt to learn how to play golf ..."

msgid "stage603-large.512"
msgstr "... I could play on Saturdays with Kelling and that idiot Howard Dole."

msgid "stage603-large.513"
msgstr "It's like the one in Taffy's office."

msgid "stage603-large.514"
msgstr "At the moment I don't need to call anyone."

msgid "stage603-large.515"
msgstr "Well, well, so you work for The Quill ..."

msgid "stage603-large.516"
msgstr "... I see they hire younger and younger people every day."

msgid "stage603-large.517"
msgstr "Well, what do you want, Mr. Esmon ...?"

msgid "stage603-large.518"
msgstr "Ashman, Mr. Hannover. Ron Ashman."

msgid "stage603-large.519"
msgstr "Ah, yes, Ashman!"

msgid "stage603-large.520"
msgstr "Well, what brings you here?"

msgid "stage603-large.521"
msgstr "I may be a busy man, but I always have time for the press."

msgid "stage603-large.522"
msgstr "Time is money, young man!"

msgid "stage603-large.523"
msgstr "Still here, young man?"

msgid "stage603-large.524"
msgstr "What do you want now ...?"

msgid "stage603-large.525"
msgstr "... but first, would you like a cup of coffee?"

msgid "stage603-large.526"
msgstr "Don't you just love a great conversation over a nice cup of coffee?"

msgid "stage603-large.527"
msgstr "... Will you excuse me? I'm not feeling very well."

msgid "stage603-large.528"
msgstr "I'll take a another one, maybe it can make me feel better, how about you?"

msgid "stage603-large.529"
msgstr "Taffy! Two coffees please."

msgid "stage603-large.530"
msgstr "But... Don't you want to sit down?"

msgid "stage603-large.531"
msgstr "Ah...! Young people nowadays don't want to waste time sitting down!"

msgid "stage603-large.532"
msgstr "Always in a hurry ..."

msgid "stage603-large.533"
msgstr "... but I must confess that I was the same way in your age."

msgid "stage603-large.534"
msgstr "I see you still won't sit down ..."

msgid "stage603-large.535"
msgstr "... not a moment to lose, eh? ..."

msgid "stage603-large.536"
msgstr "... I like that, yes sir, I do."

msgid "stage603-large.537"
msgstr "What a girl! What a treasure! ..."

msgid "stage603-large.538"
msgstr "... She'll go far, I tell you. But tell me, tell me ..."

msgid "stage603-large.539"
msgstr "Excuse me. I'll be with you in a moment ..."

msgid "stage603-large.540"
msgstr "I wanted to talk about the “Hollywood Monsters” party this year, at your Hollywood mansion ..."

msgid "stage603-large.541"
msgstr "Ah, yes! Wonderful party! ..."

msgid "stage603-large.542"
msgstr "... It cost me a fortune, you know."

msgid "stage603-large.543"
msgstr "What do you want to know?"

msgid "stage603-large.544"
msgstr "How's business?"

msgid "stage603-large.545"
msgstr "Good, I can't deny that I make a lot, but it's not like it used to be ..."

msgid "stage603-large.546"
msgstr "... The movie budgets are becoming more and astronomical and as for the salaries of the actors, don't even ask about it! They're eating all our profits."

msgid "stage603-large.547"
msgstr "At this rate I don't know how long I can keep M.K.O. above water ..."

msgid "stage603-large.548"
msgstr "I met your secretary. I see you know how to choose your people well ..."

msgid "stage603-large.549"
msgstr "Yes, I like to surround myself with people with good ..."

msgid "stage603-large.550"
msgstr "... brains."

msgid "stage603-large.551"
msgstr "And this girl has two huge assets that drive me crazy ..."

msgid "stage603-large.552"
msgstr "... initiative and ability!"

msgid "stage603-large.553"
msgstr "Well, I think I chose the wrong career. Do you think I could have a future as an actor ...?"

msgid "stage603-large.554"
msgstr "Why not? This is Hollywood, the land of dreams ..."

msgid "stage603-large.555"
msgstr "... everything is possible here!"

msgid "stage603-large.556"
msgstr "And now that you mention it, you look surprisingly like a star from the golden era, Robert Feynman ..."

msgid "stage603-large.557"
msgstr "Nothing else, Mr. Hannover. Thank you for seeing me."

msgid "stage603-large.558"
msgstr "Farewell!"

msgid "stage603-large.559"
msgstr "You're welcome, young man. Goodbye!"

msgid "stage603-large.560"
msgstr "Tell me about the Werewolf who won the Actor of the Year Award ..."

msgid "stage603-large.561"
msgstr "The Werewolf? He's undoubtetly our biggest star at the moment, the Alpha male ..."

msgid "stage603-large.562"
msgstr "... He earned this award with his merit. All his films have been huge box office successes ..."

msgid "stage603-large.563"
msgstr "... but with each new film his demands grow more and more outrageous."

msgid "stage603-large.564"
msgstr "If he continues this way he'll earn more than our gross income."

msgid "stage603-large.565"
msgstr "Tell me about Dracula who won the Honorary Award for Lifetime Achievement ..."

msgid "stage603-large.566"
msgstr "Dracula was the best, but now he simply refuses to do other roles."

msgid "stage603-large.567"
msgstr "He just doesn't want to accept that he can't play the handsome hero anymore."

msgid "stage603-large.568"
msgstr "I've offered him several minor roles lately, and gave him the chance to play more mature characters ..."

msgid "stage603-large.569"
msgstr "... but he only wants to play the handsome one, and be of course the main character."

msgid "stage603-large.570"
msgstr "Tell me about the Mummy who won the Best Dramatic Role Award."

msgid "stage603-large.571"
msgstr "I must admit that he was sublime in “The Curse of the Nile” ..."

msgid "stage603-large.572"
msgstr "... but, between you and me, I must confess that this role was meant for Frankenstein. If only the Mummy knew about it!"

msgid "stage603-large.573"
msgstr "... He can't even stand hearing about Frankenstein!"

msgid "stage603-large.574"
msgstr "I have a movie script in my hands which is ideal for the both of them, “Revenge of the Turk brothers”, but the Mummy absolutely refuses to work with Frankenstein."

msgid "stage603-large.575"
msgstr "Did you notice anything suspicious ...?"

msgid "stage603-large.576"
msgstr "Suspicious? I don't understand, young man. What do you mean ...? "

msgid "stage603-large.577"
msgstr "Actually, I wanted to talk to you about something else ..."

msgid "stage603-large.578"
msgstr "Tell me, tell me ..."

msgid "stage603-large.579"
msgstr "You see, my partner, Sue Bergman, disappeared at that party ..."

msgid "stage603-large.580"
msgstr "Ah, yes! I remember her!"

msgid "stage603-large.581"
msgstr "Beautiful young girl, indeed. You say she has disappeared !? ..."

msgid "stage603-large.582"
msgstr "... I'll tell you something, I'm certain she'll appear in a couple of days telling everybody about her romantic affair with one of my actors ..."

msgid "stage603-large.583"
msgstr "... It won't be the first time."

msgid "stage603-large.584"
msgstr "I was told that Frankenstein was acting somewhat nervous that night ..."

msgid "stage603-large.585"
msgstr "Well, with the way he moves around, who can really tell if he's nervous or not?"

msgid "stage603-large.586"
msgstr "He may present himself as a scientist, but don't forget that he's a man made \v\vwith pieces from many different bodies ..."

msgid "stage603-large.587"
msgstr "... One leg might want to go left while the other right ..."

msgid "stage603-large.588"
msgstr "Don't get me wrong Mr. Hannover. I'm sure the party was wonderful."

msgid "stage603-large.589"
