msgid "stage710-large.500"
msgstr "I can't stand being locked up here for a single minute more."

msgid "stage710-large.501"
msgstr "Impossible. I need something to force it."

msgid "stage710-large.502"
msgstr "Don't just stand there looking like an idiot ..."

msgid "stage710-large.503"
msgstr "... try to find a way to get to me out of here."

msgid "stage710-large.504"
msgstr "I don't know if I can use it for anyting, but ..."

msgid "stage710-large.505"
msgstr "It's from an old movie, “Birmingham”."

msgid "stage710-large.506"
msgstr "I'm lucky I don't find rats disgusting."

msgid "stage710-large.507"
msgstr "I can't. It's bolted to the wall."

msgid "stage710-large.508"
msgstr "Better leave it where it is."

msgid "stage710-large.509"
msgstr "It's one of those metal plates that cover access holes in the walls."

msgid "stage710-large.510"
msgstr "It's covering the rathole."

msgid "stage710-large.511"
msgstr "I knew that rat would take the bait."

msgid "stage710-large.512"
msgstr "It's filthy. It's so disgusting that I didn't get a wink of sleep all night."

msgid "stage710-large.513"
msgstr "No way! I'll never lie down there."

msgid "stage710-large.514"
msgstr "It's quite high and looks very sturdy."

msgid "stage710-large.515"
msgstr "It doesn't lead anywhere."

msgid "stage710-large.516"
msgstr "It's used for calling that idiot guard, Jerry."

msgid "stage710-large.517"
msgstr "Ron, I'll call the guard ..."

msgid "stage710-large.518"
msgstr "... and try to make him open the door."

msgid "stage710-large.519"
msgstr "You hide, and when he opens it, approach him from behind and take him out.."

msgid "stage710-large.520"
msgstr "Okay."

msgid "stage710-large.521"
msgstr "I hope it doesn't wake too soon."

msgid "stage710-large.522"
msgstr "It took a big hit, it must be dizzy."

msgid "stage710-large.523"
msgstr "I don't know what it's used for."

msgid "stage710-large.524"
msgstr "I don't know what I can do with it."

msgid "stage710-large.525"
msgstr "They're hanging from ropes. They don't exactly fill me with trust."

msgid "stage710-large.526"
msgstr "I don't know what I could do with them."

msgid "stage710-large.527"
msgstr "They're old but solid."

msgid "stage710-large.528"
msgstr "It's very rusty."

msgid "stage710-large.529"
msgstr "It's full of patches."

msgid "stage710-large.530"
msgstr "There're lots of them ..."

msgid "stage710-large.531"
msgstr "... but they're tangled with each other."

msgid "stage710-large.532"
msgstr "The rat got out for a little stroll."

msgid "stage710-large.533"
msgstr "I'd better wait until the rat comes out."

msgid "stage710-large.534"
msgstr "Great idea!"

msgid "stage710-large.535"
msgstr "I knew it would fall into my trap!"

msgid "stage710-large.536"
msgstr "Done!"

msgid "stage710-large.537"
msgstr "I will not put it back."

msgid "stage710-large.538"
msgstr "I don't think I can open it with this."

msgid "stage710-large.539"
msgstr "I can't get it open with this."

msgid "stage710-large.540"
msgstr "I don't need it."

msgid "stage710-large.541"
msgstr "I can't, the lock is on the outside."

msgid "stage710-large.542"
msgstr "I'm going to do it, if it helps me get out of here sooner than later."

msgid "stage710-large.543"
msgstr "I know you always act like a child, but really... now isn't the time to play games."

msgid "stage710-large.544"
msgstr "No, it could break."

msgid "stage710-large.545"
msgstr "No, I'll ruin it."

msgid "stage710-large.546"
msgstr "No way!"

msgid "stage710-large.547"
msgstr "I don't want to hurt it."

msgid "stage710-large.548"
msgstr "Here, see if you can do something with this ..."

msgid "stage710-large.549"
msgstr "Baby, you're amazing ..."

msgid "stage710-large.550"
msgstr "You haven't done anything useful either."

msgid "stage710-large.551"
msgstr "Sue, you won't be able to fool even the most naive man in the wolrd."

msgid "stage710-large.552"
msgstr "Are you refering to yourself, my dear?"

msgid "stage710-large.553"
msgstr "Hey, Sue. I see they gave you the luxury suite again, eh? He, he, he ..."

msgid "stage710-large.554"
msgstr "At least now you understand why you should've left the job to a REAL reporter."

msgid "stage710-large.555"
msgstr "I'll cover the story, Mr. Kelling! I'll cover the story, Mr. Kelling!"

msgid "stage710-large.556"
msgstr "Amateur."

msgid "stage710-large.557"
msgstr "Sue, there's something I've always wanted to tell you ..."

msgid "stage710-large.558"
msgstr "... but, but ... I've never mustered the courage ..."

msgid "stage710-large.559"
msgstr "... Sue, you see ... I ... ehhhhhh ... always ..."

msgid "stage710-large.560"
msgstr "I always thought you were an idiot, actually!"

msgid "stage710-large.561"
msgstr "Shut up and let me think!"

msgid "stage710-large.562"
msgstr "Yes?"

msgid "stage710-large.563"
msgstr "Jerry, darling. I'm hungry."

msgid "stage710-large.564"
msgstr "You've eaten your meal and besides, I've given you my lunch too ..."

msgid "stage710-large.565"
msgstr "... I have nothing more to give you."

msgid "stage710-large.566"
msgstr "I'm very thirsty, Jerry."

msgid "stage710-large.567"
msgstr "I'm very sorry ..."

msgid "stage710-large.568"
msgstr "... but I'm afraid that until somebody comes to relieve me I can't bring you anything to drink."

msgid "stage710-large.569"
msgstr "I need to use the bathroom, honey."

msgid "stage710-large.570"
msgstr "I can't do anything about it right now ..."

msgid "stage710-large.571"
msgstr "... you'll have to make do with whatever you have in there."

msgid "stage710-large.572"
msgstr "Jerry, sweetheart, listen, I have to get out of here."

msgid "stage710-large.573"
msgstr "I'd love to help you, but Mr. Hannover would certainly kill me if I did."

msgid "stage710-large.574"
msgstr "Can you do me a favor, honey?"

msgid "stage710-large.575"
msgstr "What?"

msgid "stage710-large.576"
msgstr "Get out of here and don't ever bother me again."

msgid "stage710-large.577"
msgstr "You sure know how to make a man feel guilty, eh?"

msgid "stage710-large.578"
msgstr "Could you let me use the phone, honey?"

msgid "stage710-large.579"
msgstr "I'm sorry, Mr. Hannover will skin me alive if I do."

msgid "stage710-large.580"
msgstr "I need to paint my toenails, but I can't reach them."

msgid "stage710-large.581"
msgstr "Paint your toenails???"

msgid "stage710-large.582"
msgstr "Well ..."

msgid "stage710-large.583"
msgstr "... I suppose there's nothing wrong with that."

msgid "stage710-large.584"
msgstr "Jerry, could you please let me out of here? I only need five minutes."

msgid "stage710-large.585"
msgstr "Not that I don't trust you, believe me ..."

msgid "stage710-large.586"
msgstr "... but if Mr. Hannover happens to arrive in those five minutes he'll award me with a nice pair of concrete shoes."

msgid "stage710-large.587"
msgstr "Forget about it, Jerry, I see you don't want to help me with anything."

msgid "stage710-large.588"
msgstr "It's your fault. You ask me for things I can't do and then you make me feel bad about it."

msgid "stage710-large.589"
msgstr "Honey, why don't you come in and have a chat with me? I'm bored."

msgid "stage710-large.590"
msgstr "I'd love to, but I can't."

msgid "stage710-large.591"
msgstr "My post is upstairs, at the entrance."

msgid "stage710-large.592"
msgstr "Jerry, dear. How about you join me in here for a little fun, if you know what I mean?"

msgid "stage710-large.593"
msgstr "Well, that'd be nice."

msgid "stage710-large.594"
msgstr "But I don't think that I owe it to you."

msgid "stage710-large.595"
msgstr "Ron ..."

msgid "stage710-large.596"
msgstr "Yes?"

msgid "stage710-large.597"
msgstr "Have you thought of anything yet?"

msgid "stage710-large.598"
msgstr "Well, if you stopped bothering all the time, maybe I could have thought of something by now."

msgid "stage710-large.599"
msgstr "Have you managed to get the damn key yet?"

msgid "stage710-large.600"
msgstr "No ..."

msgid "stage710-large.601"
msgstr "... if only you had a way to make the guard leave his post ..."

msgid "stage710-large.602"
msgstr "Perhaps you should ask for help."

msgid "stage710-large.603"
msgstr "I don't think it's a good idea to leave you here alone, Sue."

msgid "stage710-large.604"
msgstr "Besides, Kelling wants you back in the office as soon as possible. He says you owe him a story."

msgid "stage710-large.605"
msgstr "I can't think of anything. How about you?"

msgid "stage710-large.606"
msgstr "Nothing much."

msgid "stage710-large.607"
msgstr "This guard is so stubborn and stupid! Exactly like you actually!"

msgid "stage710-large.608"
msgstr "You have to lure him in so that he opens the door ..."

msgid "stage710-large.609"
msgstr "... You're a woman... more ot less... so use your womanly wiles."

msgid "stage710-large.610"
msgstr "I'll think about it."

msgid "stage710-large.611"
msgstr "Okay, me too."
